Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.71,0:01:44.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,非洲共和國奧爾德林自治區內
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.22,0:01:46.97,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,有疑似藍色宇宙攻擊部隊入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:50.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(800,975)}艦內
