Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:54.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(735,770)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(770,975)}MS發射甲板
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.91,0:01:54.56,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,各隊員請立即開展各自工作
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.55,0:01:58.08,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,根據行為探查 推測入侵部隊來自卡納吉市
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:59.68,Screen,0,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(824,975)}艦內
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:59.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(860,975)}主艦橋
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,預計在下一個05遭遇
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.98,0:02:05.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,固定與羅盤總部和奧爾德林自治政府的通話路線
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.97,0:02:09.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Operation Niner 022 展開行動
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.23,0:02:11.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和隊準備出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.17,0:02:14.40,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,彈射位置 α隊從20號推進器…
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵方是一個中隊的規模
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不過這是現場部隊的報告
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,數量再多預估一些也好
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是情況似乎很緊急
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.65,0:02:25.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.43,0:02:28.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom參戰後 由辛負責守衛政府設施
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜瑪麗亞和阿格尼絲 在引導市民疏散的同時
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.95,0:02:34.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,負責掩護奧爾德林軍
Dialogue: 2,0:02:34.51,0:02:35.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又是這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.25,0:02:39.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長 前線的敵人我來消滅 請務必讓我同行
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長 我也要去
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 我不想擴大戰場
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.23,0:02:46.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈肯隊負責保護千年號
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,交給我吧 隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,彈射器連接
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全系統連線
Dialogue: 2,0:02:53.50,0:02:56.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,航線清理完畢 沒有障礙物
Dialogue: 2,0:02:56.56,0:03:00.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防空監視組在 D2頻道共享空域監視數據
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,紅隊完成撤離
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,格魯古古 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.01,0:03:05.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜瑪利亞·霍克機
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.56,0:03:07.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,格魯古古 出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.26,0:03:11.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,強人奔流 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲·吉本拉特 強人 出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Justice 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.51,0:03:22.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥 Justice 出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.95,0:03:27.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,接下來請Freedom出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.43,0:03:33.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和 Freedom 出擊
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這裡是世界和平監測組織羅盤
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.16,0:05:21.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,通告進攻部隊 請立即停止戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又用這些東西
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲 掩護我
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,說什麼呢 我的機體是用於近戰的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,該你來掩護我的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.07,0:06:37.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,該死 根本輪不到我發揮啊
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,後撤 戰線後撤
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,並在卡納吉市重建陣地
Dialogue: 2,0:06:51.07,0:06:53.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧爾德林防禦司令部通知
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這場戰鬥的幕後黑手是米蓋爾
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.80,0:06:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要求控制卡納吉市
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.54,0:06:59.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把米蓋爾揪出來
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.41,0:07:02.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:07.94,Screen,卡纳基,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,765)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(944,975)}卡{\alpha&HFF&\t(85,85,1,\alpha&H00&)}納{\alpha&HFF&\t(168,168,1,\alpha&H00&)}基{\alpha&HFF&\t(252,252,1,\alpha&H00&)}市{\alpha&HFF&\t(335,335,1,\alpha&H00&)}區
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:07.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,765)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)\alpha&HFF&\t(502,502,1,\alpha&H00&)}A{\alpha&HFF&\t(585,585,1,\alpha&H00&)}M{\alpha&HFF&\t(669,669,1,\alpha&H00&)}4{\alpha&HFF&\t(752,752,1,\alpha&H00&)}:{\alpha&HFF&\t(836,836,1,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(919,919,1,\alpha&H00&)}5
Dialogue: 2,0:07:05.87,0:07:08.96,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,警告 請停止前進
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.19,0:07:11.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米蓋爾上校不在這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,繼續戰鬥會波及平民
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,形勢一變就成這樣了嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.26,0:07:21.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但沒有人會作出選擇
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.64,0:07:25.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人們會忘記 然後重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.43,0:07:27.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 2,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,閃一邊去
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們是米蘭的仇人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼就是不懂呢
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.42,0:08:00.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然和真不是一個水平的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,734呼叫指揮中心
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.01,0:08:22.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,城市北部居民區有多人急需救援
Dialogue: 2,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,將他們轉移到市民醫院
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.27,0:08:25.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,指揮中心呼叫734
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因市民醫院同樣受災 不予收治
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.52,0:08:29.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請等待臨時急救站開放
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.92,0:08:34.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,312報告 火勢已超出我們的應對範圍 請求滅火隊支援
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,165呼叫指揮中心 消防車因橋梁坍塌無法通過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:44.66,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(738,680)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}羅盤所屬\N大天使級強襲激動特裝艦大天使格納庫
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.11,0:08:44.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,準將等四人 請求登船
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,允許登船 辛苦了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:48.33,0:08:51.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,喲 機體似乎都挺好的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,覺得怎麼樣 新機型還習慣嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.01,0:08:55.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.69,0:08:56.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:08:59.28,0:09:00.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,傷亡情況如何
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.31,0:09:06.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目前已有257人死亡 其中包括68名平民
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也許還會增加
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.91,0:09:11.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這次沒有母艦
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.84,0:09:14.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只能靠MS發動奇襲
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是米蓋爾的網路
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但他參戰是假動作
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.95,0:09:23.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真正目的是讓扎夫特侵犯國境
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.53,0:09:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他肯定是以為把名字作為誘餌 就一定會上鉤吧
Dialogue: 2,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,每次都和 多瑪 阿羅 萊哈 一樣的把戲
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.05,0:09:33.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們還要這樣持續多久
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.26,0:09:41.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,從一開始就不考慮回程的計劃
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.59,0:09:43.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,駕駛員和機體都撐不住的
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.74,0:09:45.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但他們還在繼續
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以這才是問題所在
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.32,0:09:53.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,實際上 問題已經爛到根了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,宇宙伊拉 73
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,始於「Break the World」
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.45,0:10:03.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,地球與P.L.A.N.T.的新戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.63,0:10:09.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,歷經千辛萬苦 終於落下帷幕
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.56,0:10:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,作為新世界系統而呈現的命運計劃也是一樣
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.99,0:10:19.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,隨著其提出者杜蘭達爾委員會主席的死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:22.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(732,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}L5宙域P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.53,0:10:21.11,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,一切都被埋葬了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:21.59,0:10:25.19,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,留下了深深的悲傷和混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:26.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.21,0:10:30.05,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,克萊因總裁不知道我軍傷亡情況嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市最高評議會大廈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(874,975)}樓內
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(906,975)}小會議室
Dialogue: 2,0:10:30.68,0:10:35.15,Sub-CN - up,1,0,0,0,,遭受藍色宇宙單方面入侵的 是我們啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.64,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,考慮到士兵們的感受
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.64,0:10:40.52,Sub-CN,1,0,0,0,,大和隊長的行為太無情了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.88,Sub-CN,协调者 调整者,0,0,0,,自然人與調整者之間的裂痕
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仍然沒有被修復
Dialogue: 2,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,加之各地發生的獨立運動
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.29,0:10:55.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在米蓋爾上校的帶領下 藍色宇宙一直進行著游擊戰
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.94,0:11:00.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,衝突和仇恨現在仍在上演
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.64,0:11:11.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,擔心現狀的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:11.07,0:11:14.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T. 奧布 大西洋聯邦的指導者
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.12,0:11:18.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,成立世界和平監測組織羅盤
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.35,0:11:23.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,邀請拉克絲·克萊因擔任第一任總裁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(870,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高評議會大廈內
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1056,975)}Evidence01
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:30.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1250,975)}Replicaobject
Dialogue: 2,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,拉美德議長 讓您憂心了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.79,0:11:29.43,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.95,0:11:34.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但賈格納特等人不得不說一些嚴厲的話
Dialogue: 2,0:11:35.04,0:11:37.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我聽說軍隊內部的憤懣正在增長
Dialogue: 2,0:11:38.21,0:11:38.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但只要羅盤在其中緩衝
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.36,0:11:44.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怨憤應該也不會集中爆發
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也有個極限啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.90,0:11:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雖然我清楚只有愚蠢的人才忘記不了仇恨
Dialogue: 2,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我們也會被自己的情緒所支配
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.32,0:11:58.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們失去的太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.98,0:11:59.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.85,0:12:01.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡納吉市的米蓋爾最後在哪呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:03.29,0:12:07.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他的藏身之處果然是歐亞聯邦的軍事緩衝區嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.49,0:12:10.18,Sub-CN,为什么有个.,0,0,0,,很可能是
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.63,0:12:14.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使知道但我們也無能為力
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這就是我們的現狀啊
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.61,0:12:17.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:19.03,0:12:22.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是千年號時隔一個月的回歸嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:12:23.21,0:12:27.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這次准將能休息一會嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.43,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,是的 按計劃來說是可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:32.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1086,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高評議會大廈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:32.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1126,975)}空中庭院
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.09,0:12:31.65,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 2,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,說起來 我雖然見過幾次
Dialogue: 2,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是個奇特的人呢
Dialogue: 2,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.02,0:12:47.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他安靜得 看起來不像是個戰士
Dialogue: 2,0:12:48.01,0:12:52.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,現在看來他正試圖獨自承擔這場戰爭的矛盾
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.26,0:12:55.39,Sub-CN,，,0,0,0,,他很善良
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.74,0:12:56.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.66,0:13:03.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我得盡快讓他自由
Dialogue: 2,0:13:04.62,0:13:07.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在善良擊垮他之前
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是塔奧閣下的…
Dialogue: 2,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請多關照 國防委員會主席
Dialogue: 2,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這邊請
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.24,0:13:25.10,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,以上就是基盤王國的奧拉女王的提議
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(962,975)}奧布聯合酋長國
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1036,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,646)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1118,975)}奧羅法特
Dialogue: 2,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,應該也向P.L.A.N.T.提交了
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.68,0:13:32.85,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那個國家似乎已經非常準確地掌握了米蓋爾的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.54,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(980,975)}歐普聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:32.54,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1016,975)}首長代表官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.96,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(806,975)}樓內
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:35.96,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(840,975)}首長代表辦公室
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我認為值得合作
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 2,0:13:38.63,0:13:39.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是托亞
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.92,0:13:42.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,事物有兩面性
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.90,0:13:45.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,回報是什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,加入羅盤
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.95,0:13:53.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想以此為契機被國際社會承認為獨立國家嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.88,0:13:56.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盤王國獨立後
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.76,0:14:00.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,技術和經濟都有著顯著的發展
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但與歐亞聯邦的關係不好
Dialogue: 2,0:14:03.31,0:14:08.11,Sub-CN,调轴以适配屏字,0,0,0,,畢竟歐亞聯邦各地也是藉他們的機會大鬧獨立呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(914,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(952,975)}羅盤本部大廈
Dialogue: 2,0:14:08.41,0:14:10.20,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,指的是基盤王國衝擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:14.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,727)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(850,975)}樓內
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:14.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,727)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(880,975)}總裁辦公室
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.23,0:14:15.37,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,為什麼他們能實現如此驚人的復興呢
Dialogue: 2,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我聽說是奧費·拉姆·塔奧的功勞
Dialogue: 2,0:14:19.04,0:14:22.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,據說前議長迪蘭達爾認可了他的才華
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,總裁對命運計劃持懷疑態度嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 我不是…
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.77,0:14:36.03,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們否認了迪蘭達爾議長所展現的未來
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.52,0:14:40.15,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,然而有很多人被這種可能性所吸引
Dialogue: 2,0:14:40.66,0:14:43.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不能否認那些人
Dialogue: 2,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,確實啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.42,0:14:48.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而且如果允許他們加入羅盤
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.94,0:14:53.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤理事國和歐亞聯邦之間的關係可能會更緊張
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.18,0:14:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但在六個月前的Freedom搶奪案中
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.51,0:15:00.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧布欠了他們一筆人情
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲反對嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.27,0:15:09.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:14.72,Screen,一年前我删了,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,725)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,880)}奧布屬奧諾戈羅島
Dialogue: 2,0:15:13.13,0:15:15.21,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但是拉克絲 這是…
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.54,0:15:16.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是因為有人希望這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是我也希望
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.67,0:15:26.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和你一起戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.56,0:15:31.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1014,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.92,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1044,975)}宙港
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.62,0:15:46.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我果然沒被信任嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你看 隊長總是一個人戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.42,0:15:55.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也因此縮小了傷亡啊
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,話雖如此
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.04,0:16:00.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那我們的意義又是什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.24,0:16:06.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長當時和我說
Dialogue: 2,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要一起戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是被這些話所感動
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.27,0:16:16.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才加入羅盤的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.02,0:16:19.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 你又在胡思亂想了嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.13,0:16:22.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.39,0:16:23.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的意思是
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想變得更有用
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.24,0:16:27.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,幫上基拉隊長的…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.54,0:16:30.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真不是被託付了Justice嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒被信任怎麼…
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.41,0:16:35.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼不可能呢
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.43,0:16:38.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,尤其是被稱為「Freedom Killer」的你
Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「Freedom Killer」
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.17,0:16:41.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 你不知道嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不知何時會背刺你的人
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.68,0:16:49.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的話絕對不想把他留在身邊
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.46,0:16:50.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把Justice讓給我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你操縱它也是暴殄天物
Dialogue: 2,0:16:57.30,0:17:00.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,學院裡我的技術和評價都更好
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.68,0:17:03.30,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,別說了 阿格尼絲
Dialogue: 2,0:17:02.81,0:17:05.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大戰時我也覺得很怪
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.03,Sub-CN,*,0,0,0,,沒想到你進了FAITH
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但到頭來對迪蘭達爾議長來說
Dialogue: 2,0:17:10.76,0:17:13.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你就是個好用的棋子而已吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.44,0:17:15.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.30,0:17:21.01,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 2,0:17:17.67,0:17:21.83,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,奧爾德林自治區的傷亡情況已經高達428人死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:25.31,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}基拉和拉克絲的宅邸
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.97,0:17:26.77,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目前為止 藍色宇宙殘黨已造成超過5000人的傷亡
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.33,0:17:29.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各國政府對此高度關切
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.64,0:17:33.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,同時對幕後黑手米蓋爾上校進行國際通緝
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.38,0:17:37.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們正在努力瓦解此組織 但其下落尚未確認
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.93,0:17:42.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,藍色宇宙的殘黨…
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.05,0:17:45.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:17:47.31,0:17:48.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊哦
Dialogue: 2,0:17:55.66,0:17:56.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 2,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要太勉強自己啊
Dialogue: 2,0:17:59.33,0:18:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不承認!
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.01,0:18:03.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,費米子引導方式尚不可用
Dialogue: 2,0:18:03.39,0:18:06.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,微米級障礙物影響連接感測器出現錯誤 真的難以理解
Dialogue: 2,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你認為可以解決嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,海因萊因上尉
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.03,0:18:12.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只能由我這個設計師來做了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我對開發部門的無能感到震驚
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,設置和適應Freedom都需要時間
Dialogue: 2,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自我維持控制程序中的錯誤也是一個令人頭疼的問題
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.28,0:18:22.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我來負責這個項目
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,感測器就麻煩海因萊因上尉了
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.63,0:18:26.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對不起 准將
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.63,0:18:32.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不回家 真的好嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.78,0:18:33.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,克萊茵總裁不是在等您嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:18:36.83,0:18:40.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我需要能夠盡快使用它
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.26,0:18:42.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.00,0:18:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,壓倒敵人的能力是解決問題的最快方法
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: 2,0:18:49.63,0:18:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們沒有保護好任何東西
Dialogue: 2,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.64,0:19:18.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.20,0:19:59.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不會再發生那種事了
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要讓世界變成那樣
Dialogue: 2,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,誰又能保證呢
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.45,0:20:09.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你口中的世界和我所展示的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:20:09.60,0:20:11.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家更想要哪一個
Dialogue: 2,0:20:14.06,0:20:14.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有史以來
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.58,0:20:18.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人類史上戰爭從未停止過的原因
Dialogue: 2,0:20:19.33,0:20:22.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一直存在的 對我們來說最大的敵人
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.96,0:20:26.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是你任何時候都克服不了的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那就是我們自身的無知和貪婪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:06.03,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}Aprilius郊外
Dialogue: 2,0:21:18.43,0:21:19.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米蓋爾上校他
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.96,0:21:23.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好像潛伏在歐亞邊境附近的埃爾多安
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,從基盤王國的奧拉陛下那收到了
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.70,0:21:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請求合力逮捕的親筆信
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.10,0:21:32.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲你怎麼打算
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.87,0:21:36.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,說實話還在猶豫
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.25,0:21:39.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉你怎麼想
Dialogue: 2,0:21:40.58,0:21:41.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼問我
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.59,0:21:43.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 2,0:21:49.32,0:21:51.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果事情能就此結束的話
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.41,0:21:53.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我沒有反對的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.95,0:21:54.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這場戰爭看不到盡頭
Dialogue: 2,0:21:58.05,0:21:59.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人是不會輕易改變的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:00.72,0:22:02.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.27,0:22:04.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能做到什麼 不能做到什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.92,0:22:05.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 2,0:22:06.63,0:22:07.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能做到的事
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.06,0:22:10.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.20,0:22:14.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必須要有人去做
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.47,0:22:17.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果沒有人做的話
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.30,0:22:25.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是歐亞聯邦不承認羅盤吧
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.20,0:22:29.00,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,所以總裁自己要求同行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.70,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(966,975)}千年號
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.70,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(996,975)}艦長室
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.40,0:22:32.53,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,也許會有政治談判什麼的
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.14,0:22:36.00,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗨 老大們 小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:38.12,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(816,975)}千年號
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:38.12,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,726)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(858,975)}休息室
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.42,0:22:38.52,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那裡可能會有妖怪出沒呢
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.93,0:22:39.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,蛤?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.59,0:22:41.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是基盤王國
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那裡獨立運動時
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.43,0:22:45.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,歐亞人看到了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.94,0:22:47.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,凱爾派
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.82,0:22:48.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,凱爾派是什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是生活在水裡的怪物
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.61,PS,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs60}凱爾特民間傳說中變成駿馬外形誘拐路人的精靈
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.18,0:22:56.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是說 這個國家本身就像妖怪一樣看不透摸不清
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.37,0:22:56.97,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.67,0:22:57.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怪物妖怪
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.21,0:22:59.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈肯大尉
Dialogue: 2,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可以性騷擾
Dialogue: 2,0:23:09.69,0:23:11.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距離突破大氣層還有20秒
Dialogue: 2,0:23:12.07,0:23:13.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.31,0:23:14.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全艙壁封閉
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.59,0:23:18.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本艦即將突進大氣層
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.56,0:23:20.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦橋向裝甲區域轉移
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.07,0:23:22.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,R2協議發令
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.89,0:23:25.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全員準備突入大氣層
Dialogue: 2,0:23:25.24,0:23:27.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,冷卻系統正常
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.29,0:23:28.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,高熱屏蔽運作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(992,975)}基盤王城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1068,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.30,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1148,975)}伊修塔利亞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.72,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1080,975)}基盤
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.72,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1114,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.14,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1054,975)}基盤
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:38.14,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1086,975)}議事廳
Dialogue: 2,0:23:47.22,0:23:49.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,重建的進展似乎比我想像的要快
Dialogue: 2,0:23:50.22,0:23:53.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為有非常優秀的人民或政府吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:53.78,0:23:54.67,Sub-CN,千年号 千禧年,0,0,0,,千年號
Dialogue: 2,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向右舷合流
Dialogue: 2,0:23:56.13,0:23:58.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對空對地繼續警戒
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.81,0:24:03.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,下降路徑和水深數據 沒有問題
Dialogue: 2,0:24:04.21,0:24:06.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,懸浮器輸出保持20
Dialogue: 2,0:24:07.24,0:24:10.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,D人員確認並報告水密狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:33.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(912,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:33.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(948,975)}直升機場
Dialogue: 2,0:24:37.08,0:24:38.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,歡迎您的到來 公主
Dialogue: 2,0:24:38.61,0:24:41.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是基盤王國的宰相奧費·拉姆·塔奧
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.01,0:24:43.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發自內心歡迎您的到來
Dialogue: 2,0:24:44.22,0:24:45.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤總裁
Dialogue: 2,0:24:45.45,0:24:46.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我叫拉克絲·克萊因
Dialogue: 2,0:24:47.23,0:24:49.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常榮幸能見到您
Dialogue: 2,0:25:03.86,0:25:05.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,終於能夠見到你了
Dialogue: 2,0:25:06.20,0:25:07.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲·克萊因
Dialogue: 2,0:25:07.85,0:25:08.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:09.64,0:25:10.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:11.22,0:25:12.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是你的命運之人
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.77,0:25:16.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起引領世界之人
Dialogue: 2,0:25:19.70,0:25:20.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,0:25:33.58,0:25:34.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,礙事的傢伙
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.66,0:25:36.32,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 2,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,喂 快跑
Dialogue: 2,0:26:04.67,0:26:06.49,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,歡迎來到基盤王國
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:10.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,689)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(920,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:10.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,689)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(954,975)}謁見之間
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.33,0:26:08.78,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我是奧拉·瑪哈·海貝爾
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.63,0:26:13.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此次羅盤的應對之迅速 吾深表感謝
Dialogue: 2,0:26:14.68,0:26:19.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,承蒙您的接見 我深感榮幸 奧拉陛下
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.01,0:26:24.17,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,米蓋爾的游擊隊 對於我們國家來說也是頗為棘手的
Dialogue: 2,0:26:24.63,0:26:27.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我已經多次向歐亞聯邦提議
Dialogue: 2,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.58,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,但似乎回應還要花些時間
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.48,0:26:32.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒有辦法
Dialogue: 2,0:26:33.18,0:26:36.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為那邊國內還有許多火種存在
Dialogue: 2,0:26:37.42,0:26:42.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在此先向你們致謝 請保護我的國民
Dialogue: 2,0:26:42.92,0:26:44.30,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,您言重了
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.61,0:26:47.45,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我們必當竭盡全力
Dialogue: 2,0:26:48.03,0:26:51.48,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我安排了小小的歡迎會
Dialogue: 2,0:26:52.81,0:26:56.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請在那和我細說你們的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:14.69,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,684)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(942,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.69,0:27:14.69,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,684)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(976,975)}練兵場
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.69,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,他們是我國的近衛師團
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.14,0:27:20.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們就是傳聞的黑騎士
Dialogue: 2,0:27:31.83,0:27:34.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是贏不了修拉
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.89,0:27:38.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能指導一場我嗎 大和隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:27:39.34,0:27:40.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 我…
Dialogue: 2,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不會用劍的隊長嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:27:44.77,0:27:48.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤意外沒什麼了不起的呢
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.74,0:27:51.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這點我之前已經證實了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:51.39,0:27:53.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們對客人太失禮了
Dialogue: 2,0:27:54.62,0:27:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長這裡就讓我來
Dialogue: 2,0:27:57.24,0:27:57.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:27:58.46,0:27:59.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,讓他上吧
Dialogue: 2,0:28:01.72,0:28:04.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近衛師團長 修拉·塞爾彭坦
Dialogue: 2,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和隊 真·飛鳥
Dialogue: 2,0:28:18.69,0:28:19.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.18,0:28:39.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼啊 「Freedom Killer」也沒什麼了不起的
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.44,0:28:41.00,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,這不還算好的嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:28:43.42,0:28:45.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然阿斯蘭·薩拉才是最強的
Dialogue: 2,0:28:46.70,0:28:47.50,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,你說誰啊…
Dialogue: 2,0:28:47.50,0:28:48.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別說了 真
Dialogue: 2,0:28:51.24,0:28:53.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,塞爾彭坦團長 請注意一下分寸
Dialogue: 2,0:28:54.09,0:28:56.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只有有力量的人才能統治世界
Dialogue: 2,0:28:57.65,0:28:59.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你有這種力量嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:29:01.11,0:29:03.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人們並不期望這樣的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:29:04.80,0:29:05.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:29:06.98,0:29:08.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我非常期待在你的指揮下作戰
Dialogue: 2,0:29:10.30,0:29:12.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你真的太沒出息了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:12.96,0:29:15.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,早知如此 就讓我上好了
Dialogue: 2,0:29:15.34,0:29:16.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別說了 阿格尼絲
Dialogue: 2,0:29:17.24,0:29:18.76,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲·吉本拉特
Dialogue: 2,0:29:19.84,0:29:21.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,月光女武神嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:29:21.54,0:29:22.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:29:22.96,0:29:23.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.36,0:29:27.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,強者是美麗的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:37.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(968,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:37.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,600)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)}大廳
Dialogue: 2,0:29:40.29,0:29:43.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,貴國的繁榮 我早已有所耳聞
Dialogue: 2,0:29:44.70,0:29:49.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不論出身和年齡 優秀的人才我國都會任用
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.46,0:29:53.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也不管是自然人還是調整者
Dialogue: 2,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這都是奧費的安排
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.00,0:30:02.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,能陪我跳一曲嗎 公主
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我很樂意
Dialogue: 2,0:30:44.24,0:30:48.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不過 沒想到黑騎士竟是那樣的少爺小姐
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們是什麼身份呢
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.78,0:30:52.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是調整者嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.13,0:30:55.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我猜也是 但是…
Dialogue: 2,0:30:56.28,0:30:56.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 2,0:30:57.70,0:31:00.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看起來實在不像是一支正規軍
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.10,0:31:03.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要跳舞嗎 隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:31:05.04,0:31:07.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們可不是過來玩的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:11.39,0:31:14.89,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,別這樣了 就知道招惹隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:31:15.41,0:31:17.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼 我做錯什麼了
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.79,0:31:20.91,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,可是 你真的喜歡那個人嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:31:21.50,0:31:24.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不打算隨便妥協
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.54,0:31:26.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不像你
Dialogue: 2,0:31:27.08,0:31:28.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:31:28.31,0:31:31.10,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,沒說什麼 好啦要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:49.01,Screen,王城 蔷薇之庭,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,730)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(880,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:49.01,Screen,王城 蔷薇之庭,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,730)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(910,975)}薔薇之庭
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.70,0:31:53.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哪怕是那麼燦爛的花
Dialogue: 2,0:31:53.98,0:31:56.34,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,似乎也無法入你的眼呢
Dialogue: 2,0:31:59.44,0:32:01.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這花是為你而綻放的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:01.96,0:32:02.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請收下
Dialogue: 2,0:32:03.88,0:32:07.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,謝謝 非常漂亮
Dialogue: 2,0:32:07.79,0:32:10.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太好了 如果你不喜歡的話
Dialogue: 2,0:32:11.04,0:32:13.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,玫瑰們就要在失望中枯萎了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.47,0:32:17.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,聞起來很香
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.32,0:32:21.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然還是笑容和你最配
Dialogue: 2,0:32:23.01,0:32:25.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也能理解你的煩惱
Dialogue: 2,0:32:25.71,0:32:26.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:32:26.71,0:32:27.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,任誰都是如此吧
Dialogue: 2,0:32:28.69,0:32:32.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對現在活著的人 尋找通往未來的人來說
Dialogue: 2,0:32:34.40,0:32:36.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人們不希望發生衝突
Dialogue: 2,0:32:36.77,0:32:39.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但另一方面衝突又不會消失
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.96,0:32:44.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,調整者和自然人雖都同是人
Dialogue: 2,0:32:46.38,0:32:47.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但可悲的是
Dialogue: 2,0:32:48.06,0:32:50.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人們會用這種微不足道的事作為鬥爭的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:32:51.88,0:32:52.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.20,0:32:54.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我是這麼想的
Dialogue: 2,0:32:55.42,0:32:57.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,問題不在於這細微的差別對待
Dialogue: 2,0:32:57.88,0:33:00.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而在於社會真的做到了公平嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:33:02.44,0:33:04.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,現在每個人都背負著戰火的陰影
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.55,0:33:08.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不平和不滿就會在這時候 醜陋地展示出來
Dialogue: 2,0:33:10.37,0:33:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為財富分配不公平
Dialogue: 2,0:33:12.54,0:33:14.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為生命的重量不一樣
Dialogue: 2,0:33:14.66,0:33:16.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為從社會得不到正確的評價
Dialogue: 2,0:33:17.33,0:33:19.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以人們才會互相鬥爭
Dialogue: 2,0:33:19.84,0:33:21.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果我們能呈現一個
Dialogue: 2,0:33:22.54,0:33:24.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,每個人都能被別人所需的公正平等的社會的話
Dialogue: 2,0:33:25.26,0:33:27.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就能跨越調整者和自然人之間的差異
Dialogue: 2,0:33:27.68,0:33:29.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,世界一定能向著更好的方向發展
Dialogue: 2,0:33:30.77,0:33:31.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是這麼想的
Dialogue: 2,0:33:33.06,0:33:37.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常好的想法 也許確實是這樣
Dialogue: 2,0:33:38.22,0:33:42.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,公主如此認可我 我就有自信做好宰相了
Dialogue: 2,0:33:46.37,0:33:49.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想創造一個沒有貧困和歧視的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:33:49.80,0:33:51.73,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我就是為此而生的
Dialogue: 2,0:33:53.28,0:33:54.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還有你
Dialogue: 2,0:34:02.22,0:34:04.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 奧費閣下
Dialogue: 2,0:34:04.82,0:34:07.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舟車勞頓 我似乎有些疲憊了了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:07.62,0:34:09.53,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,請容許我先行告辭
Dialogue: 2,0:34:10.18,0:34:13.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,非常感謝您今天的款待
Dialogue: 2,0:34:20.23,0:34:21.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我給你帶了宵夜
Dialogue: 2,0:34:22.42,0:34:24.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,謝謝 放那裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:31.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,643)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(920,975)}千年號
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:31.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,643)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(956,975)}整備指揮所
Dialogue: 2,0:34:31.20,0:34:32.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗯 怎麼了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.43,0:34:35.70,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我覺得隊長很可憐
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.58,0:34:40.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她在大家面前和別的男人親熱地跳舞
Dialogue: 2,0:34:40.78,0:34:43.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明隊長接下來又要去危險的戰場了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.94,0:34:46.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,不論如何 那都是工作需要
Dialogue: 2,0:34:47.08,0:34:48.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,您為什麼不生氣呢
Dialogue: 2,0:34:49.14,0:34:52.24,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,那個人是在利用隊長的溫柔
Dialogue: 2,0:34:55.06,0:34:58.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看看我 你也想回敬她 不是嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:34:58.92,0:34:59.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:35:00.54,0:35:02.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 2,0:35:04.56,0:35:06.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼她就可以
Dialogue: 2,0:35:06.94,0:35:10.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的話就不會把心愛的人送往戰場
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.94,0:35:13.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自己卻只在安全的地方看著
Dialogue: 2,0:35:13.65,0:35:15.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:15.95,0:35:17.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你什麼都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.27,0:35:31.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(689,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(966,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.27,0:35:31.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(689,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1000,975)}港口
Dialogue: 2,0:35:36.46,0:35:37.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,塔奧…閣下
Dialogue: 2,0:35:38.50,0:35:39.56,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,月亮真美
Dialogue: 2,0:35:40.14,0:35:44.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在黑暗中 平等地散發著安心至高的光
Dialogue: 2,0:35:45.14,0:35:46.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不這麼認為嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:35:46.88,0:35:48.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我們改天再說
Dialogue: 2,0:35:48.73,0:35:51.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你有資格去追她嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:35:52.82,0:35:55.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧 你配不上她
Dialogue: 2,0:35:56.70,0:35:59.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,破壞 仇恨還有死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:35:59.86,0:36:02.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所創造全是這些東西
Dialogue: 2,0:36:02.61,0:36:03.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:36:07.98,0:36:09.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,殺死迪蘭達爾議長後
Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.91,0:36:11.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你從這個世界上奪走了什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:36:12.69,0:36:15.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,秩序 和平與沒有衝突的社會
Dialogue: 2,0:36:15.92,0:36:18.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為了彌補人們失去的東西
Dialogue: 2,0:36:18.88,0:36:20.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你能夠說 自己已經彌補了嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:36:20.97,0:36:21.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:36:22.35,0:36:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,命運計劃所呈現的世界再也無法實現
Dialogue: 2,0:36:26.61,0:36:28.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也知道的吧
Dialogue: 2,0:36:28.63,0:36:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家希望有人幫自己決定
Dialogue: 2,0:36:30.52,0:36:33.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,自己能做的事 所期望的事
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.82,0:36:36.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她是指引著那個世界的光
Dialogue: 2,0:36:36.60,0:36:40.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,站在她身邊的人 也是指引世界的人
Dialogue: 2,0:36:42.02,0:36:43.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的話就能做到
Dialogue: 2,0:36:44.58,0:36:47.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她所期望的世界 沒有無止境的戰爭
Dialogue: 2,0:36:48.09,0:36:51.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能夠創造一個安定與和諧的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:36:52.34,0:36:53.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這種事情…
Dialogue: 2,0:36:53.72,0:36:57.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你做不到 只會戰鬥的你做不到的
Dialogue: 2,0:36:57.90,0:36:58.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 2,0:37:00.23,0:37:03.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以和平到來時 你會怎麼做
Dialogue: 2,0:37:04.34,0:37:07.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,用你沾滿鮮血的手去牽起她的手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:17.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(818,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:17.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(858,975)}MS格納庫
Dialogue: 2,0:37:18.79,0:37:19.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.36,0:37:26.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不漂亮嗎 沒有魅力嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.50,0:37:29.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼不能是我
Dialogue: 2,0:37:31.02,0:37:34.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你很美麗 月光女武神
Dialogue: 2,0:37:48.56,0:37:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真這個笨蛋 幼稚鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(900,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(695,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(932,975)}港區東亭
Dialogue: 2,0:38:01.38,0:38:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,睡不著嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:38:03.46,0:38:04.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧費閣下
Dialogue: 2,0:38:04.64,0:38:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請把我當做月亮映下的影子
Dialogue: 2,0:38:13.39,0:38:16.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要怎麼做才能把這一切都結束掉
Dialogue: 2,0:38:17.46,0:38:18.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:18.40,0:38:21.64,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,沒有爭執 在互相寬恕後一同生活
Dialogue: 2,0:38:22.11,0:38:24.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼會如此困難呢
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.06,0:38:31.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們的話 可以讓這些結束的
Dialogue: 2,0:38:35.92,0:38:38.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我出現在此就是為了幫助你
Dialogue: 2,0:38:39.12,0:38:40.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,僅僅為此
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.86,0:38:44.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 2,0:38:44.92,0:38:46.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是奧費·拉姆·塔奧
Dialogue: 2,0:38:47.38,0:38:51.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一個能與你結伴 恢復世界和平的人
Dialogue: 2,0:38:58.08,0:39:00.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有這樣的事情嗎 但…
Dialogue: 2,0:39:00.72,0:39:03.06,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,我就是為此而生的
Dialogue: 2,0:39:03.94,0:39:05.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為了完成被賦予的使命
Dialogue: 2,0:39:06.50,0:39:08.34,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,而且 包括你
Dialogue: 2,0:39:16.91,0:39:21.24,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,祈禱吧孩子們 一起向新的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.00,0:39:23.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(880,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.00,0:39:23.25,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(731,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}奧拉的臥室
Dialogue: 2,0:39:21.98,0:39:24.08,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,遵循你們各自的命運
Dialogue: 2,0:39:24.87,0:39:27.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一切都按照當初決定的那樣
Dialogue: 2,0:39:29.07,0:39:31.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,世界在等著你們
Dialogue: 2,0:39:32.22,0:39:35.67,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,這是我國所掌握的藍色宇宙游擊隊的詳細情況
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.51,0:39:36.43,Screen,王城内,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(918,975)}王城
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.51,0:39:36.43,Screen,王城内,0,0,0,,{\fad(776,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(954,975)}大會議事廳
Dialogue: 2,0:39:36.43,0:39:39.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米蓋爾占據了埃爾多安的堡壘遺跡
Dialogue: 2,0:39:39.48,0:39:43.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,確認到他們通過地下通道出入歐亞境內
Dialogue: 2,0:39:44.30,0:39:47.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕基盤王國也有類似的情況吧
Dialogue: 2,0:39:48.32,0:39:49.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看來是呢
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.54,0:39:56.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼 基盤王國部隊優先考慮市民的疏散避難
Dialogue: 2,0:39:56.36,0:39:57.88,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,以及封鎖敵人
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.37,0:40:01.76,Sub-CN,都翻了,0,0,0,,以逮捕和拘留米蓋爾上校為目標
Dialogue: 2,0:40:02.49,0:40:07.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,勸降藍色宇宙 最大限度減少人員傷亡
Dialogue: 2,0:40:07.86,0:40:10.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使號負責前線的指揮
Dialogue: 2,0:40:11.01,0:40:14.04,Sub-CN - up,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,藍色宇宙一步也不許放入我國
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1150,975)}基盤王國歐亞聯邦聯邦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,683)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1184,975)}軍事分界線
Dialogue: 2,0:40:14.98,0:40:18.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但羅盤也一樣 只能進入埃爾多安地區
Dialogue: 2,0:40:18.82,0:40:19.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.78,0:40:25.58,Sub-CN,行为,0,0,0,,越過軍事分界線者 我們將其視為侵略性為 展開攻擊
Dialogue: 2,0:40:26.08,0:40:28.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不論是羅盤 還是基盤王國
Dialogue: 2,0:40:32.50,0:40:34.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,熱源接近 數量為30以上
Dialogue: 2,0:40:34.90,0:40:38.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑暗標 反坦克彈 巴爾幹炮 開始迎擊
Dialogue: 2,0:40:43.72,0:40:47.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 阿格尼絲 希爾達負責解除敵方武裝
Dialogue: 2,0:40:47.86,0:40:49.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我負責前往米蓋爾的指揮所
Dialogue: 2,0:40:50.26,0:40:50.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.80,0:41:02.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(697,723)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}基盤王國領土內
Dialogue: 2,0:41:04.69,0:41:07.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敷島隊負責掩護Justice和Gyan
Dialogue: 2,0:41:07.51,0:41:08.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,秀景隊跟隨我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:39.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,642)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1038,975)}藍色宇宙陣地
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:39.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(693,642)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1070,975)}防空設施
Dialogue: 2,0:41:41.05,0:41:41.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,退下
Dialogue: 2,0:41:47.77,0:41:49.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:57.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,686)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(952,975)}軍事分界線內
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.82,0:41:57.24,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,686)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(986,975)}埃爾多安地區
Dialogue: 2,0:41:55.72,0:41:56.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(848,975)}王城內
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:15.26,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(882,975)}戰時情報會議室
Dialogue: 2,0:42:13.42,0:42:14.64,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,何等的卑鄙
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.32,0:42:19.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,車輛及步兵部隊撤退
Dialogue: 2,0:42:19.90,0:42:21.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是過分
Dialogue: 2,0:42:29.14,0:42:30.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 2,0:42:45.30,0:42:48.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迅速救助埃爾多安市區的傷員
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.69,0:42:49.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.09,0:42:55.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒辦法 僅限埃爾多安地區 允許你們實施救助活動
Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.20,0:42:58.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:43:06.38,0:43:07.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,作戰開始了
Dialogue: 2,0:43:08.58,0:43:10.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯 交給我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.28,0:43:11.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:43:11.47,0:43:12.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全殺光
Dialogue: 2,0:43:21.46,0:43:24.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,墮入黑暗吧 基拉大和
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1108,975)}藍色宇宙陣地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1142,975)}據點
Dialogue: 2,0:43:47.10,0:43:47.96,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:48.50,0:43:48.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:58.48,0:43:59.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,米蓋爾?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.22,0:44:16.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長 你怎麼了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:16.52,0:44:17.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我去抓捕米蓋爾
Dialogue: 2,0:44:18.16,0:44:19.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 你掩護我
Dialogue: 2,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.90,Sub-CN,与在线文档不一致,0,0,0,,啊 可是?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:21.52,0:44:22.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他要逃了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.37,0:44:27.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 基拉 你正在接近分界線了 想什麼呢
Dialogue: 2,0:44:28.22,0:44:30.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和隊長機轉向前往10H5G方向
Dialogue: 2,0:44:31.24,0:44:32.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正前往歐亞聯邦領地內
Dialogue: 2,0:44:33.36,0:44:34.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:44:35.88,0:44:38.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你怎麼了基…大和隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.22,0:44:40.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我發現了米蓋爾 前去抓捕
Dialogue: 2,0:44:40.38,0:44:40.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 2,0:44:42.80,0:44:44.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,弗拉加上校 匯報情況
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:48.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1020,975)}歐亞聯邦聯邦領土內
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:48.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1056,975)}野戰指揮所
Dialogue: 2,0:44:48.19,0:44:50.42,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,Freedom正接近軍事分界線!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:50.73,0:44:53.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼搞的 他不知道事前協議嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:44:54.23,0:44:58.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,警告 Freedom 貴機正在接近歐亞聯邦聯邦領域
Dialogue: 2,0:44:58.28,0:45:00.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請立即改變前進方向
Dialogue: 2,0:45:00.40,0:45:01.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼要去歐亞聯邦
Dialogue: 2,0:45:02.36,0:45:04.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼搞的 總裁
Dialogue: 2,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom 請立即返回
Dialogue: 2,0:45:06.84,0:45:07.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.58,0:45:08.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,警告射擊 發射
Dialogue: 2,0:45:08.98,0:45:09.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請等等
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:13.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1048,975)}歐亞聯邦聯邦國境
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.18,0:45:13.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1080,975)}防空陣地
Dialogue: 2,0:45:17.27,0:45:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還在抵抗嗎?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:18.92,0:45:19.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:45:19.75,0:45:20.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉 住手
Dialogue: 2,0:45:20.69,0:45:21.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行的 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.00,0:45:23.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要在這裡結束一切
Dialogue: 2,0:45:27.19,0:45:29.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是明確的侵略行為啊
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.59,0:45:32.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉 基拉 你聽不見嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:45:32.80,0:45:33.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是米蓋爾
Dialogue: 2,0:45:33.91,0:45:36.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能在這裡放他逃走
Dialogue: 2,0:45:37.56,0:45:39.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這不是我方的意志
Dialogue: 2,0:45:39.44,0:45:40.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只是大和隊長個人的獨斷
Dialogue: 2,0:45:40.95,0:45:43.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一開始就有這打算 所以才把羅盤帶進來的吧
Dialogue: 2,0:45:44.17,0:45:46.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那我們也要採用對策
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.52,0:45:47.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,既然如此 公主!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請等等 大和隊長肯定有他的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:45:52.22,0:45:54.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他顯然已經神志不清
Dialogue: 2,0:45:54.39,0:45:55.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,或者是反叛了
Dialogue: 2,0:45:55.60,0:45:56.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 2,0:45:56.68,0:45:58.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惜現狀就是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:45:59.03,0:46:01.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤收拾不了場面的話
Dialogue: 2,0:46:01.82,0:46:03.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就請交給我們處理
Dialogue: 2,0:46:04.36,0:46:07.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,至今為止的外交努力都要白費了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:07.58,0:46:10.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如果只因為一人的暴走 而出現人員傷亡的話
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.48,0:46:12.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可就本末倒置了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:12.83,0:46:13.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲大人
Dialogue: 2,0:46:18.33,0:46:19.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:20.54,0:46:22.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請阻止基拉…
Dialogue: 2,0:46:23.36,0:46:23.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欸?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.96,0:46:27.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是說准許對大和隊長展開攻擊 對吧?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:29.20,0:46:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:46:30.05,0:46:30.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲…
Dialogue: 2,0:46:31.25,0:46:32.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 克萊因總裁
Dialogue: 2,0:46:34.12,0:46:37.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有強電波干擾 全部信號都斷了
Dialogue: 2,0:46:37.40,0:46:39.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是NJ達茲拉的干擾
Dialogue: 2,0:46:39.54,0:46:40.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這還沒到實際使用的階段
Dialogue: 2,0:46:40.72,0:46:42.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,量子濺射的抑制是怎麼解決的?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:42.97,0:46:44.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這既不是歐亞聯邦 也不是藍色宇宙
Dialogue: 2,0:46:44.64,0:46:46.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜瑪利亞機 緊急出戰
Dialogue: 2,0:46:46.84,0:46:49.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還帶著狙擊槍和通信線
Dialogue: 2,0:46:49.11,0:46:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,聽好了 修拉 履行你的使命吧
Dialogue: 2,0:46:52.26,0:46:52.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:46:53.31,0:46:54.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,2分鐘解決
Dialogue: 2,0:46:54.64,0:46:57.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈 去死吧
Dialogue: 2,0:47:04.14,0:47:05.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑騎士?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:17.44,0:47:18.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,住手啊 為什麼!
Dialogue: 2,0:47:19.18,0:47:21.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼?你看看周圍吧
Dialogue: 2,0:47:27.60,0:47:28.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 2,0:47:29.93,0:47:31.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,殺死你
Dialogue: 2,0:47:32.86,0:47:37.44,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉啦 拉克絲公主說她已經不要你了
Dialogue: 2,0:47:51.61,0:47:52.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉
Dialogue: 2,0:47:58.66,0:47:59.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 2,0:48:03.04,0:48:03.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真 怎麼啦?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:07.48,0:48:09.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別妨礙我啊
Dialogue: 2,0:48:12.89,0:48:14.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不長記性啊
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.04,0:48:18.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,都證明過你不是我的對手啦
Dialogue: 2,0:48:25.06,0:48:25.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.12,0:48:32.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這些傢伙…果然
Dialogue: 2,0:48:33.13,0:48:35.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是陷阱 大天使號前進
Dialogue: 2,0:48:35.57,0:48:38.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,馬茲機 赫爾貝爾特機掩護我方撤退
Dialogue: 2,0:48:38.90,0:48:41.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射信號彈 前去救援基拉等人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.94,0:48:47.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(944,975)}歐亞聯邦聯邦領土內
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.94,0:48:47.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(978,975)}戰術核導彈陣地
Dialogue: 2,0:48:47.37,0:48:49.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,密碼
Dialogue: 2,0:48:57.85,0:49:00.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,監測到疑似MS熱源 距離1萬7千
Dialogue: 2,0:49:03.81,0:49:04.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑騎士?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:05.48,0:49:09.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這裡可是歐亞聯邦大後方哦 他們來這地方幹什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.22,0:49:11.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊 被看見啦
Dialogue: 2,0:49:12.05,0:49:15.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒問題 反正也是要處理掉的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:21.74,0:49:25.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,監測到疑似導彈飛行物的熱源 現在顯示光學影像
Dialogue: 2,0:49:27.43,0:49:27.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那個是…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:28.60,0:49:33.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是GLCM Mark72 巡航戰術核導彈 歐亞聯邦軍方發射的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:36.15,0:49:38.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑騎士2機正向本艦接近
Dialogue: 2,0:49:40.46,0:49:40.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:41.29,0:49:41.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 2,0:49:43.97,0:49:45.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,來自本國的
Dialogue: 2,0:49:45.98,0:49:49.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已確認是從歐亞聯邦領土內發射的戰術核導彈
Dialogue: 2,0:49:51.13,0:49:51.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目標呢?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.53,0:49:53.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是這裡
Dialogue: 2,0:49:53.65,0:49:55.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向千年號發送緊急通話
Dialogue: 2,0:49:55.84,0:49:57.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 仍然無法通信
Dialogue: 2,0:49:59.14,0:50:00.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本艦被鎖定了
Dialogue: 2,0:50:04.48,0:50:06.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主炮 1號 2號中彈!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:06.62,0:50:10.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對空戰鬥 火神炮 反坦克彈 開火
Dialogue: 2,0:50:10.44,0:50:11.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,損傷控制 開始
Dialogue: 2,0:50:12.66,0:50:14.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不好意思 給我沉下去吧
Dialogue: 2,0:50:15.42,0:50:18.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反正結果也一樣 真麻煩
Dialogue: 2,0:50:29.18,0:50:31.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,火神炮 地獄標 無法使用
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.97,0:50:34.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,多數疑似導彈的熱源正在接近
Dialogue: 2,0:50:35.13,0:50:36.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,散布對空彈頭
Dialogue: 2,0:50:36.38,0:50:37.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,右舵 全速
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.36,0:50:46.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雷射不管用
Dialogue: 2,0:50:46.81,0:50:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這就是傳說中的費姆科技裝甲嗎!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.82,0:50:52.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒錯 見過了就去死吧
Dialogue: 2,0:50:58.10,0:51:00.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,戰域坐標 020威士忌138
Dialogue: 2,0:51:01.36,0:51:01.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,0:51:04.38,0:51:06.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,情況怎麼樣了 真
Dialogue: 2,0:51:06.71,0:51:09.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,誤射?這解釋得通嗎!那可是核武!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:10.03,0:51:11.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,到底是哪個笨蛋做的
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 不受這邊的控制
Dialogue: 2,0:51:15.42,0:51:18.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,少將 基盤王宮發來了直接通信
Dialogue: 2,0:51:18.89,0:51:19.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,連上
Dialogue: 2,0:51:26.81,0:51:29.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全員撤退 也請向全市發送緊急避難通知
Dialogue: 2,0:51:30.28,0:51:32.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,盡可能讓市民前往地下避難
Dialogue: 2,0:51:34.48,0:51:35.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這邊請
Dialogue: 2,0:51:35.78,0:51:36.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.57,0:51:37.24,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請快些
Dialogue: 2,0:51:47.21,0:51:49.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦橋關閉 急速潛航
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.57,0:51:52.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好的 打開排口 千年號 急速潛航!
Dialogue: 2,0:52:05.48,0:52:05.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是那個吧
Dialogue: 2,0:52:19.06,0:52:20.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太好啦
Dialogue: 2,0:52:24.22,0:52:25.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,第二發改變了航道
Dialogue: 2,0:52:26.14,0:52:26.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 2,0:52:27.35,0:52:29.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快躲避 露娜瑪利亞 已經無法狙擊了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:30.59,0:52:32.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不試試怎麼知道
Dialogue: 2,0:52:35.30,0:52:37.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,準備完成立即出發
Dialogue: 2,0:52:54.14,0:52:55.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,給我打中
Dialogue: 2,0:53:35.39,0:53:36.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這些傢伙到底…
Dialogue: 2,0:53:41.79,0:53:44.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盤機體…可惡
Dialogue: 2,0:53:46.70,0:53:48.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主炮 火神炮 全滅
Dialogue: 2,0:53:49.02,0:53:51.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,運作停止 火勢正往彈藥庫蔓延
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.79,0:53:55.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,切斷引擎 放棄戰艦 全員離艦!
Dialogue: 2,0:53:56.10,0:53:57.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全員撤退!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:04.77,0:54:06.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,做好衝擊準備!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:13.27,0:54:16.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大姐頭不在 可以大展身手啦
Dialogue: 2,0:54:20.07,0:54:21.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嘖 這就是怪物…
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.02,0:54:23.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對不起 大姐頭
Dialogue: 2,0:54:27.16,0:54:29.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,馬茲 赫爾貝爾特
Dialogue: 2,0:54:58.97,0:55:00.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們竟敢!
Dialogue: 2,0:55:07.07,0:55:08.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.90,0:55:18.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,終於到了嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:55:14.66,0:55:16.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,時限到了呢
Dialogue: 2,0:55:21.10,0:55:22.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使號…
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.58,0:55:24.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別東張西望的
Dialogue: 2,0:55:42.70,0:55:43.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抓住我手 小子
Dialogue: 2,0:55:49.74,0:55:49.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 2,0:55:59.74,0:56:00.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你這小子打不贏的
Dialogue: 2,0:56:01.57,0:56:02.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:56:05.24,0:56:07.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為那就是你的命運啊
Dialogue: 2,0:56:07.89,0:56:08.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 2,0:56:18.57,0:56:20.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那傢伙由我來下手
Dialogue: 2,0:56:27.38,0:56:28.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.05,0:56:32.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:56:45.90,0:56:46.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 2,0:56:50.72,0:56:51.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有一手
Dialogue: 2,0:56:51.28,0:56:51.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,行得通
Dialogue: 2,0:57:00.22,0:57:00.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.14,0:57:01.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 2,0:57:10.76,0:57:12.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 讓你久等啦
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.46,0:57:14.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好慢哦
Dialogue: 2,0:57:25.41,0:57:26.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭薩拉嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:57:28.81,0:57:30.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 時間到了
Dialogue: 2,0:57:33.42,0:57:34.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你來嗎
Dialogue: 2,0:57:36.31,0:57:38.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我跟你走
Dialogue: 2,0:57:42.20,0:57:44.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲…為什麼
Dialogue: 2,0:57:44.50,0:57:45.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們快逃 基拉
Dialogue: 2,0:57:45.75,0:57:47.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使號的人也一起
Dialogue: 2,0:58:19.03,0:58:19.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 2,0:58:20.77,0:58:21.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:34.54,0:58:34.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:40.07,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}阿斯哈家所有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:40.07,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H39393A&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}奧布領地曉島
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.90,0:58:40.12,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,埃爾多安悲劇4天後 現場的輻射量仍很高
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.41,0:58:44.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(896,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.41,0:58:44.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(928,975)}秘密海中船塢
Dialogue: 2,0:58:40.54,0:58:44.29,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,關係主要國的救援行動進展得並不樂觀
Dialogue: 2,0:58:45.05,0:58:46.97,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,NJC設施再次運作
Dialogue: 2,0:58:47.46,0:58:50.94,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,與此同時 地上再次噴湧出的噩夢 使世界陷入恐慌
Dialogue: 2,0:58:51.41,0:58:54.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,抗議的聲音正在日益增多
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.04,0:58:54.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(978,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.04,0:58:54.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1012,975)}海中港口
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:56.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(982,975)}奧布聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:56.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1012,975)}代表首長官邸
Dialogue: 2,0:58:55.08,0:58:59.94,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,第二爆炸地點東1.5公里處 發現了疑似大天使號的殘骸
Dialogue: 2,0:59:00.45,0:59:05.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,仍未發現Freedom和Justice以及其他參與作戰的MS
Dialogue: 2,0:59:06.06,0:59:08.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我方的呼叫也沒有得到回應
Dialogue: 2,0:59:08.92,0:59:11.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有可能全部被捲入了爆炸當中
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.77,0:59:16.73,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,722)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}基盤王國衛星基地宇域 華納海姆級行星間宇宙戰艦古爾韋格
Dialogue: 2,0:59:11.78,0:59:14.34,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,那麼克萊因總裁沒事吧
Dialogue: 2,0:59:15.28,0:59:17.70,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,嗯 根據千年號的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.90,0:59:19.82,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(952,975)}衛星基地內
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.90,0:59:19.82,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(988,975)}船錨
Dialogue: 2,0:59:18.22,0:59:20.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,她和基盤的高官一起撤離了
Dialogue: 2,0:59:21.91,0:59:22.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T.的聯繫呢
Dialogue: 2,0:59:23.82,0:59:24.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,並沒有
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.61,0:59:25.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼搞的
Dialogue: 2,0:59:26.39,0:59:28.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,歐亞聯邦發來了嚴重的抗議
Dialogue: 2,0:59:29.34,0:59:33.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,說是全怪大和隊長破壞協定 越過軍事分界線
Dialogue: 2,0:59:34.36,0:59:37.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那也不能成為發射核導彈的理由
Dialogue: 2,0:59:37.90,0:59:40.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那可是對全人類的背叛行為啊
Dialogue: 2,0:59:41.07,0:59:43.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大和隊長的事我也無法接受
Dialogue: 2,0:59:43.68,0:59:46.64,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,僅僅是看報告 有太多地方說不清楚
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.20,0:59:49.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,根本弄不清楚發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 2,0:59:49.54,0:59:51.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真實都埋藏在黑暗之中
Dialogue: 2,0:59:51.52,0:59:55.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,除非大和隊長或者米蓋爾親口說明…
Dialogue: 2,0:59:56.01,1:00:00.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒辦法追責任何人 那可真是方便啊
Dialogue: 2,1:00:00.95,1:00:02.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你想說什麼?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:02.93,1:00:07.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我想說的是 大和隊長的行動真的是他的一意孤行嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:00:08.15,1:00:12.14,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本次事件是P.L.A.N.T.介入歐亞聯邦領地的絕好機…
Dialogue: 2,1:00:12.14,1:00:13.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請停止你的刁難
Dialogue: 2,1:00:13.92,1:00:15.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉是會這麼做的人嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:00:17.13,1:00:18.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐
Dialogue: 2,1:00:18.85,1:00:19.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:00:20.23,1:00:24.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼我國從此以後 將不再與羅盤進行交流
Dialogue: 2,1:00:24.61,1:00:28.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們也是 絕不會忍受這樣的無端猜疑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:39.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1016,975)}奧布聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:39.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1052,975)}淤能碁呂島
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(842,975)}千年號
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(948,975)}軍官室
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.44,1:00:44.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1050,975)}真的房間
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.23,1:00:42.26,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,不想承認
Dialogue: 2,1:00:48.78,1:00:50.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼還不回來啊
Dialogue: 2,1:00:51.46,1:00:52.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真個傻瓜
Dialogue: 2,1:00:53.18,1:00:56.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 果然是基盤王國嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.37,1:00:59.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,從干擾的時機來看 有92%的可能性有幕後黑手
Dialogue: 2,1:00:59.77,1:01:00.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是黑色騎士搞的鬼
Dialogue: 2,1:01:01.36,1:01:04.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為叫黑色騎士 所以是黑的…
Dialogue: 2,1:01:06.07,1:01:10.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼核攻擊也是基盤王國發動的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:01:10.72,1:01:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我們沒有辦法證明這點
Dialogue: 2,1:01:14.06,1:01:16.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號既沒有收到回港命令 也沒有配備MS
Dialogue: 2,1:01:16.76,1:01:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大天使號也被擊沉 船員的生存機率很小
Dialogue: 2,1:01:20.25,1:01:21.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,究竟如何呢
Dialogue: 2,1:01:22.41,1:01:25.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群人會這麼輕易地死掉嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.53,1:01:28.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(844,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.53,1:01:28.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(872,975)}海底港內研究室
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.08,1:01:29.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,包括基盤王國 埃爾多安地區在內推測出現死者五萬
Dialogue: 2,1:01:29.87,1:01:33.11,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,傷者 失蹤者超過十萬人
Dialogue: 2,1:01:33.51,1:01:37.21,Sub-CN - up,调轴-跟电视一起关,0,0,0,,歐亞聯邦軍準備報仇 命令全軍時刻準備出擊…
Dialogue: 2,1:01:37.85,1:01:39.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們兩個都沒事了嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:01:39.97,1:01:41.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒事了
Dialogue: 2,1:01:44.84,1:01:45.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 2,1:01:45.87,1:01:49.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目前羅盤的活動已被凍結
Dialogue: 2,1:01:52.14,1:01:54.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤被凍結是真的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:01:55.05,1:01:57.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒錯 雖然卡嘉莉努力爭取過了
Dialogue: 2,1:01:58.18,1:02:00.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但現在全世界都在非難羅盤
Dialogue: 2,1:02:01.95,1:02:03.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群傢伙 該死
Dialogue: 2,1:02:04.41,1:02:07.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,唯一倖存的千年號現在停泊在奧布
Dialogue: 2,1:02:08.51,1:02:10.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還沒有通知他們我們的情況
Dialogue: 2,1:02:11.83,1:02:12.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲呢?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:13.26,1:02:16.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她好像坐基盤王國的太空梭安全離開了
Dialogue: 2,1:02:17.58,1:02:20.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她背叛了我們
Dialogue: 2,1:02:26.83,1:02:29.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,終端調查到了這些資訊
Dialogue: 2,1:02:31.03,1:02:33.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是奧拉女帝?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:33.91,1:02:38.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是她19年前在孟德爾基因研究所的樣子
Dialogue: 2,1:02:38.53,1:02:39.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,19年前
Dialogue: 2,1:02:41.53,1:02:45.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她的研究課題是創造出超越調整者的人種
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.86,1:02:52.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,846)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3F&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}軌道間全方位戰略炮『鎮魂曲』
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.43,1:02:53.31,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,偏轉線圈1號 3號 6號完成朝預定地點的展開
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.66,1:02:56.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1168,975)}基盤王國衛星基地內
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.66,1:02:56.20,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1200,975)}控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:02:53.85,1:02:56.02,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目標準星修正 +2.3
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.50,1:02:59.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}基盤王國軍\N華納海姆級行星間宇宙戰艦 『古爾韋格』機庫
Dialogue: 2,1:02:56.57,1:02:59.89,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,距離「鎮魂曲」發射臨界還有T-60
Dialogue: 2,1:03:00.34,1:03:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系統工作正常
Dialogue: 2,1:03:02.56,1:03:07.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕一切都在奧拉 在他們的計劃之中
Dialogue: 2,1:03:11.84,1:03:12.97,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,核攻擊也是
Dialogue: 2,1:03:14.07,1:03:17.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,至少也能以他們發起核攻擊為藉口
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.00,1:03:19.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」發射準備結束
Dialogue: 2,1:03:20.44,1:03:21.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,賜予我神的祝福
Dialogue: 2,1:03:24.33,1:03:27.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們以此為藉口進攻歐亞聯邦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.15,1:03:30.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1048,975)}歐亞聯邦聯邦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.15,1:03:30.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1082,975)}首都
Dialogue: 2,1:03:44.46,1:03:45.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐
Dialogue: 2,1:03:46.46,1:03:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,薩拉上校立刻前往控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:03:49.24,1:03:50.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,趕緊收集情報
Dialogue: 2,1:03:50.59,1:03:53.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,固定連接羅盤司令部以及奧布政府的線路
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}奧布聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1020,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:55.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1154,975)}海底控制室
Dialogue: 2,1:03:54.70,1:03:55.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,莫斯科…
Dialogue: 2,1:03:56.40,1:03:59.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這就是基盤王國的復仇? 已經開始了?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:00.78,1:04:02.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,核… 攻擊?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:02.95,1:04:04.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不對 這是…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:07.86,1:04:09.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(784,975)}奧布聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(970,975)}代表首長官邸內
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.36,1:04:12.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1156,975)}戰時情報會議室
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.65,1:04:12.72,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」不是被解體了嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:04:12.86,1:04:15.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,P.L.A.N.T.這是赤裸裸地違反停戰協議
Dialogue: 2,1:04:16.21,1:04:18.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這樣的復仇 我們絕不能姑息
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.57,1:04:21.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大總統…
Dialogue: 2,1:04:21.34,1:04:23.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你說什麼 立刻連接上
Dialogue: 2,1:04:24.94,1:04:29.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為自然人發射的仇恨的核彈 我們被逐出了地面
Dialogue: 2,1:04:31.25,1:04:33.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們只渴望和平與安定的願望
Dialogue: 2,1:04:34.71,1:04:37.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,又一次被頑固愚蠢的自然人踐踏
Dialogue: 2,1:04:38.28,1:04:38.84,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.14,1:04:43.68,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我國接受了前任P.L.A.N.T.評議會會長
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.27,1:04:44.77,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1148,975)}基盤王國衛星基地內
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.27,1:04:44.77,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(939,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1180,975)}司令官室
Dialogue: 2,1:04:44.40,1:04:47.73,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,吉爾伯特·迪蘭達爾 作為國策所提倡的「命運計劃」
Dialogue: 2,1:04:49.14,1:04:52.27,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,建立在基因基礎上 完全公平且平等的社會
Dialogue: 2,1:04:53.14,1:04:57.19,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,通過接受刻於自己基因中的使命
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.07,1:05:00.08,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(904,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.07,1:05:00.08,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(938,975)}湍津姬海岸
Dialogue: 2,1:04:58.02,1:04:59.83,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們克服了貧困
Dialogue: 2,1:05:00.29,1:05:02.21,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,在先前的大戰中獲得獨立
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(892,975)}奧布聯合首長國
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.91,1:05:04.62,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}淤能碁呂島「輝夜」
Dialogue: 2,1:05:02.93,1:05:05.01,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,讓世界看到了我們奇蹟般的復興
Dialogue: 2,1:05:05.55,1:05:09.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,然而 怠惰的人們看不慣我們的成就
Dialogue: 2,1:05:10.24,1:05:14.30,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,他們否定進化 嫉妒他人 無法忘記過去的仇恨
Dialogue: 2,1:05:14.65,1:05:17.03,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,懷著醜陋的情感互相殘殺
Dialogue: 2,1:05:17.89,1:05:19.66,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,住在名為地球的安寧之地
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.97,1:05:22.81,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1064,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高評議會樓內
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.97,1:05:22.81,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1094,975)}情報官辦公室
Dialogue: 2,1:05:20.01,1:05:23.14,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,卻又和貪婪地消耗這份恩惠的寄生蟲一般
Dialogue: 2,1:05:24.15,1:05:25.13,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們想發問
Dialogue: 2,1:05:25.73,1:05:30.28,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,為什麼我們必須和這些蒙昧之輩一同前進
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:30.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(570,975)}扎夫特
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:30.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(606,975)}納茲卡級高速戰艦『布克哈特』艦橋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:34.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(828,975)}Aprilius市
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.40,1:05:34.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp0\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(860,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高評議會大樓前
Dialogue: 2,1:05:32.34,1:05:34.36,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,住在P.L.A.N.T.的調整者們啊
Dialogue: 2,1:05:35.27,1:05:36.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們是你們的同胞
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.84,1:05:38.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們和我們一樣
Dialogue: 2,1:05:39.08,1:05:41.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,都是將人類的進化帶向未來的人種
Dialogue: 2,1:05:43.14,1:05:47.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們也是基因編輯而誕生的究極調整者 超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:05:43.14,1:05:47.92,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\pos(1400,992)}Accord
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.03,1:05:54.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們刻在基因裡的使命 就是作為人類的調停者引領世界
Dialogue: 2,1:05:55.52,1:05:57.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們就是為此而誕生
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.84,1:06:00.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1172,975)}基盤王國衛星基地內
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.84,1:06:00.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1204,975)}貴賓室
Dialogue: 2,1:05:58.57,1:06:03.48,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,你們引領者之一的拉克絲·克萊因總裁也是我們的同胞
Dialogue: 2,1:06:04.27,1:06:07.94,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,她作為人類的引領者 現在也和我們站在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.19,1:06:11.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(898,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.19,1:06:11.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(928,975)}馬爾奇歐的教會
Dialogue: 2,1:06:09.21,1:06:11.06,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們的意志即是她的意志
Dialogue: 2,1:06:11.79,1:06:13.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們的願望也是她的願望
Dialogue: 2,1:06:14.95,1:06:17.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起前進吧 調整者的同胞們
Dialogue: 2,1:06:18.55,1:06:21.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舊人類掀起的矛盾和暴虐的時代已經結束了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:23.61,1:06:25.78,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們向地球上所有國家發出通告
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.45,1:06:26.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1092,975)}P.L.A.N.T.最高評議會
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.45,1:06:26.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1120,975)}議場
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.48,1:06:30.72,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻解除武裝 承認命運計劃並予以執行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:29.88,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(850,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:29.88,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(880,975)}議長事務室
Dialogue: 2,1:06:31.66,1:06:33.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們有5天時間考慮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.34,1:06:37.63,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(746,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.34,1:06:37.63,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(778,975)}地下緊急逃生艇
Dialogue: 2,1:06:33.60,1:06:37.23,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此外 對於不接受我們的勢力
Dialogue: 2,1:06:37.84,1:06:42.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,將以拉克絲·克萊因之名 降下「鎮魂曲」的制裁
Dialogue: 2,1:06:43.39,1:06:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們的頭上必將降下米吉多之火吧
Dialogue: 2,1:06:43.39,1:06:46.00,PS,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs44}位於以色列的古城 啟示錄預言中滅世之戰的地方
Dialogue: 2,1:06:46.96,1:06:48.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 2,1:06:49.86,1:06:50.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:06:52.56,1:06:53.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,議長到艦橋了
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.48,1:06:58.13,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,玖爾女士 卡納巴前代表 多謝相助
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:07:01.82,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,925)}Terminal 所屬\N永恆級MS專用母艦『永恆』艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:06:59.02,1:07:03.32,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,但是我無法這樣坐視國內的騷亂發展下去
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.90,1:07:05.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白 議長
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.08,1:07:10.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,最壞的情況 「鎮魂曲」的準星會再次指向P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:10.77,1:07:13.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,現在必須看清形勢 暫時隱藏身形
Dialogue: 2,1:07:14.54,1:07:15.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,相關的準備呢?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:16.61,1:07:18.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雖然算不上萬無一失
Dialogue: 2,1:07:19.51,1:07:24.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,廢棄波阿斯里有拉克絲大人囑託的用於抵抗的補充設施
Dialogue: 2,1:07:25.13,1:07:25.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們將去往那裡…
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.86,1:07:27.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:28.34,1:07:31.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,讓你一個人等這麼久真是抱歉 公主
Dialogue: 2,1:07:32.20,1:07:33.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真想表明歉意的話
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.25,1:07:38.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,希望能盡快讓我回去
Dialogue: 2,1:07:39.38,1:07:39.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,回去?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:40.86,1:07:43.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你本來的歸宿就是這裡
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.06,1:07:47.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這也是你母親的意志
Dialogue: 2,1:07:48.80,1:07:49.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母親的?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.00,1:07:57.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,命運計劃依據基因篩選人類 根據適應性決定使命
Dialogue: 2,1:07:58.67,1:08:03.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迪蘭達爾和奧拉創造了管理這個體系 引領人類的人們
Dialogue: 2,1:08:04.38,1:08:05.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那就是超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:08:09.44,1:08:11.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是為了普羅大眾而生
Dialogue: 2,1:08:12.30,1:08:15.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為了被所有人們愛戴 為他們指明方向
Dialogue: 2,1:08:17.09,1:08:19.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我就是為此創造出了你
Dialogue: 2,1:08:20.65,1:08:22.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,創造了… 我
Dialogue: 2,1:08:23.77,1:08:28.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,然後 他們超越者最首要的關鍵就是奧費·拉姆·塔奧
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.95,1:08:30.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,以及拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:08:32.80,1:08:33.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:08:35.01,1:08:39.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們兩人是應該站在所有人類頂點的人
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.02,1:08:43.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是最終拼圖的一角
Dialogue: 2,1:08:44.60,1:08:48.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我和你要一起統治這個世界
Dialogue: 2,1:08:49.66,1:08:50.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,感受得到吧
Dialogue: 2,1:08:52.28,1:08:54.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一起? 和你?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:55.61,1:08:59.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們的命運就是互相吸引 結為連理
Dialogue: 2,1:09:01.25,1:09:03.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以他們搶走了拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:09:04.10,1:09:06.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為他們的計劃需要她
Dialogue: 2,1:09:08.99,1:09:09.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:09:14.96,1:09:18.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我愛的人不是你
Dialogue: 2,1:09:20.79,1:09:22.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在想基拉·大和的事情嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:09:23.72,1:09:26.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遺憾的是 他已經不在這個世上了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:27.76,1:09:30.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是你下命令攻擊他的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:09:33.78,1:09:34.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:09:35.05,1:09:38.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管怎樣 對今後的世界而言 他已經沒有用了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.28,1:09:41.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不是…
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.14,1:09:44.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不是因為需要才愛他
Dialogue: 2,1:09:45.70,1:09:47.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而是因為愛他才需要他的
Dialogue: 2,1:09:48.90,1:09:51.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,夠了 別再說這種自然人一樣的胡話了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:53.14,1:09:53.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我出擊了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.66,1:09:57.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 英格利特 母親和公主就拜託了
Dialogue: 2,1:09:59.83,1:10:03.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,根據情報 目前P.L.A.N.T.正處於軍隊領導的武裝政變中
Dialogue: 2,1:10:04.53,1:10:05.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,詳情還不清楚
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.03,1:10:08.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但我們無法聯絡到議長以下的評議會成員
Dialogue: 2,1:10:10.08,1:10:12.32,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我們現在無計可施
Dialogue: 2,1:10:12.90,1:10:14.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們既沒有MS也沒有戰艦
Dialogue: 2,1:10:15.35,1:10:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是說 我們在這裡就跟死人沒有差別
Dialogue: 2,1:10:20.34,1:10:24.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,據我推測 超越者可以讀取我們的內心
Dialogue: 2,1:10:25.58,1:10:29.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,恐怕還可以影響人的精神吧
Dialogue: 2,1:10:30.22,1:10:31.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以隊長才…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.49,1:10:37.12,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(872,975)}地球聯合軍
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.49,1:10:37.12,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(904,975)}恩底彌翁基地
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.91,1:10:38.46,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,基盤王國在地球各國完全投降之後
Dialogue: 2,1:10:38.87,1:10:41.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,勸告各國解除武裝 施行命運計劃
Dialogue: 2,1:10:42.66,1:10:46.90,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,並聲明若不聽從勸告 將立即發射「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:50.47,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}小野鳴島
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.05,1:10:50.47,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(916,975)}戰死者慰靈公園
Dialogue: 2,1:10:47.39,1:10:51.81,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,此時 將不允許任何平民避難
Dialogue: 2,1:10:56.13,1:11:00.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們去救拉克絲吧 除此之外別無他法
Dialogue: 2,1:11:00.79,1:11:04.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們需要她的話語 來破除僵局 阻止P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:06.97,1:11:07.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒用的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:09.03,1:11:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉君?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:10.21,1:11:11.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反正都是一樣的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.97,1:11:13.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管我們做什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:11:14.17,1:11:15.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發現扎夫特艦隊
Dialogue: 2,1:11:15.62,1:11:18.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我方艦隊的右翼 左翼 前方展開隊形
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(606,975)}地球聯合軍
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(642,975)}阿伽門農級母艦『貝武夫』艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:11:18.56,1:11:20.22,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,艦隊左翼受到炮擊
Dialogue: 2,1:11:21.13,1:11:22.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各艦向右迴避
Dialogue: 2,1:11:22.92,1:11:23.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,右翼也受到炮擊
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.18,1:11:30.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能靠得太緊 會受到「鎮魂曲」的正面攻擊
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.64,1:11:44.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,到頭來還是重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.90,1:11:48.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那樣掙扎 迷茫 戰鬥過來
Dialogue: 2,1:11:48.65,1:11:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,戰鬥 不斷地戰鬥
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.31,1:11:53.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是什麼都沒有改變
Dialogue: 2,1:11:54.47,1:11:57.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是因為我做錯了嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.34,1:11:59.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.44,1:12:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以拉克絲才拋棄我 選擇了他
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.70,1:12:05.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是錯的啊
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.40,1:12:09.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲希望的東西 我一個都給不了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:09.30,1:12:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別說和平了 甚至無法讓她露出笑顏
Dialogue: 2,1:12:13.85,1:12:18.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我無法讓她幸福 所以她背叛了我
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.80,1:12:24.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別說些沒用的牢騷
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.30,1:12:26.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只知道自己 自己的
Dialogue: 2,1:12:26.40,1:12:30.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一點都沒考慮過她的心情吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.45,1:12:33.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,夠了 這麼討厭戰鬥的話
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.20,1:12:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就在這裡畏畏縮縮地爛掉吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:35.40,1:12:41.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你懂什麼 就這麼說我
Dialogue: 2,1:12:44.85,1:12:47.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你打算一個人戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:12:47.40,1:12:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我能怎麼辦 你們太弱了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:50.75,1:12:52.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:52.35,1:12:55.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你就打算一個人背負世界
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.30,1:12:57.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不合心意就放任不管嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:12:57.75,1:12:59.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是了不起的英雄啊
Dialogue: 2,1:12:59.35,1:13:01.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 2,1:13:05.90,1:13:08.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,住手 阿斯蘭 放開隊長
Dialogue: 2,1:13:11.15,1:13:12.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,該死
Dialogue: 2,1:13:12.45,1:13:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,讓他們打吧
Dialogue: 2,1:13:14.60,1:13:19.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,朋友就是該幫自以為是的混蛋看清現實
Dialogue: 2,1:13:19.75,1:13:21.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必須…
Dialogue: 2,1:13:21.10,1:13:23.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必須由我來做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:23.40,1:13:26.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不喜歡 但是拚了命地做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:26.00,1:13:27.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼不說出來
Dialogue: 2,1:13:27.95,1:13:30.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼不拜託別人
Dialogue: 2,1:13:30.45,1:13:34.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你一個人能做到什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:13:40.50,1:13:42.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想見拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:13:44.25,1:13:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:13:46.00,1:13:49.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明我只希望你能在我身邊歡笑而已
Dialogue: 2,1:13:49.80,1:13:55.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我到底應該怎麼做
Dialogue: 2,1:13:55.65,1:14:00.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不過一會沒見 拉克絲的變化還真大啊
Dialogue: 2,1:14:00.95,1:14:04.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,像這樣不去做就無法幸福
Dialogue: 2,1:14:04.10,1:14:07.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,做不到就不行之類的
Dialogue: 2,1:14:07.05,1:14:11.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道的拉克絲可不會說這種話
Dialogue: 2,1:14:13.80,1:14:18.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲希望世界和平
Dialogue: 2,1:14:18.05,1:14:23.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 她也沒想著讓人把和平像禮物一樣送給她吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:23.80,1:14:28.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,她希望的難道不是和她一起朝這個目標前進的同伴嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:14:28.70,1:14:32.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一步一步 就算步子很小
Dialogue: 2,1:14:32.60,1:14:36.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲現在還這麼想嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:14:36.65,1:14:40.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不安的話 就見個面問問吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:40.35,1:14:43.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,走吧 基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:14:43.05,1:14:45.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,去救拉克絲吧
Dialogue: 2,1:14:45.00,1:14:46.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們一起
Dialogue: 2,1:14:46.75,1:14:50.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有些事情必須說出來
Dialogue: 2,1:14:57.15,1:14:58.80,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我分析了航跡
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.59,1:15:01.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(690,975)}L1 宙域
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.59,1:15:01.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(728,975)}終端據點衛星『工廠』
Dialogue: 2,1:14:58.80,1:15:02.50,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,確定了基盤王國的太空梭前往的宙域
Dialogue: 2,1:15:02.50,1:15:06.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,綜合奧布的情報 拉克絲恐怕在…
Dialogue: 2,1:15:06.20,1:15:09.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿耳忒彌斯要塞 棘手了啊
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.45,1:15:13.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,利用托利和布魯的量子網路可以確定拉克絲的位置
Dialogue: 2,1:15:13.85,1:15:17.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只要接近就能夠確定位置對吧
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.30,1:15:21.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要是拉克絲還帶著的話
Dialogue: 2,1:15:21.50,1:15:23.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦船要怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 2,1:15:23.30,1:15:26.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們也沒有能正式戰鬥的MS
Dialogue: 2,1:15:26.45,1:15:29.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦船的話 說不定可以弄到
Dialogue: 2,1:15:29.55,1:15:32.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雖然方法有點粗魯
Dialogue: 2,1:15:32.30,1:15:35.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我或許可以提供MS
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.92,1:15:39.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}曉島
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.92,1:15:39.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}地下極密機庫
Dialogue: 2,1:15:37.60,1:15:39.60,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,阿斯哈代表託付給我們的
Dialogue: 2,1:15:39.60,1:15:44.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本來用於新型融合爐和新裝備的性能評測實驗
Dialogue: 2,1:15:44.30,1:15:48.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒想到會出現這種事態
Dialogue: 2,1:15:48.10,1:15:49.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:15:49.20,1:15:50.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:15:50.70,1:15:53.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雖然驅動裝置和武器裝備還是老樣子
Dialogue: 2,1:15:53.60,1:15:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是操作系統更新成了最新版
Dialogue: 2,1:15:57.00,1:16:01.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,雖然和黑色騎士對抗還是有些沒底
Dialogue: 2,1:16:01.15,1:16:07.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 有了這台機體 怎麼會輸給那種傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:16:27.55,1:16:29.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 2,1:16:32.50,1:16:35.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦長 是噴射攻擊
Dialogue: 2,1:16:35.50,1:16:37.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:16:37.40,1:16:40.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請船員立刻離開艦船
Dialogue: 2,1:16:40.00,1:16:43.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,重複 緊急警報 緊急警報
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.30,1:16:45.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦內甲板B出現有毒氣體
Dialogue: 2,1:16:45.95,1:16:48.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:16:49.35,1:16:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 2,1:16:50.25,1:16:52.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是… 是的
Dialogue: 2,1:16:52.85,1:16:57.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,比我的計算晚了兩分鐘 大和隊長
Dialogue: 2,1:16:57.15,1:16:59.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近衛艦長?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:59.25,1:17:02.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出航準備已經結束了 拉米亞斯上校
Dialogue: 2,1:17:02.70,1:17:06.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不用穿這麼誇張的東西的
Dialogue: 2,1:17:10.70,1:17:13.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 2,1:17:13.05,1:17:16.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,把手舉起來 把槍丟掉
Dialogue: 2,1:17:26.05,1:17:28.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜 是我是我
Dialogue: 2,1:17:28.55,1:17:29.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:17:29.85,1:17:33.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好痛 怎麼了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:35.20,1:17:37.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:17:39.40,1:17:46.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 笨蛋 我還以為你已經死了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:46.60,1:17:53.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好痛 要死了 真的要死了
Dialogue: 2,1:17:53.95,1:17:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你說千年號被黑了?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:56.45,1:18:00.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 奧布通知了P.L.A.N.T.以及大西洋聯邦
Dialogue: 2,1:18:00.85,1:18:06.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,衛星影像上看 港口周邊人員移動有些許激烈
Dialogue: 2,1:18:06.85,1:18:09.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧布 我說吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:14.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1286,975)}奧布軍建御雷級大型機動航空母艦『棉津見』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.83,1:18:14.37,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1320,975)}先頭避難艦隊
Dialogue: 2,1:18:10.85,1:18:14.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,我們要潛入阿耳忒彌斯要塞 救出拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:18:14.45,1:18:18.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,使用幻影膠質躲過敵人的探知接近
Dialogue: 2,1:18:18.10,1:18:20.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是尼可爾的戰術啊
Dialogue: 2,1:18:20.20,1:18:23.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們負責突破主力艦隊前往月球
Dialogue: 2,1:18:23.20,1:18:25.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是做誘餌吧
Dialogue: 2,1:18:25.45,1:18:28.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們知道我們的實情之後會立刻攻擊奧布
Dialogue: 2,1:18:28.15,1:18:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們要在此之前破壞「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:18:30.25,1:18:31.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」本體有護罩覆蓋
Dialogue: 2,1:18:31.85,1:18:33.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一般火力無法造成損壞
Dialogue: 2,1:18:33.80,1:18:36.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,射線中繼點用幻影膠質偽裝
Dialogue: 2,1:18:36.60,1:18:39.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在發射之前都無法預測其位置
Dialogue: 2,1:18:39.90,1:18:42.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 只有一個地方除外
Dialogue: 2,1:18:42.75,1:18:45.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,第一中繼點一定在「鎮魂曲」的正上方
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.30,1:18:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是射線的上方
Dialogue: 2,1:18:46.65,1:18:50.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即將發射時必定會在那裡
Dialogue: 2,1:18:53.90,1:18:57.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼 拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 2,1:18:57.30,1:18:59.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 哪有這種道理
Dialogue: 2,1:18:59.20,1:19:02.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這艘艦船現在既不屬於羅盤也不屬於扎夫特
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.80,1:19:05.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,而是叛亂者 也就是海賊
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.90,1:19:11.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,了解相應戰鬥方法的人才應該坐在這個座位上
Dialogue: 2,1:19:11.15,1:19:12.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:19:12.90,1:19:15.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼 請近衛上校擔任副艦長
Dialogue: 2,1:19:15.90,1:19:16.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,樂意之至
Dialogue: 2,1:19:18.40,1:19:22.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各部檢查結束 主引擎輸出上升中
Dialogue: 2,1:19:22.35,1:19:24.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距離穩定還有30秒
Dialogue: 2,1:19:24.15,1:19:25.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出航準備結束
Dialogue: 2,1:19:25.70,1:19:27.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,解開船索
Dialogue: 2,1:19:27.05,1:19:29.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,水流噴射器 連接
Dialogue: 2,1:19:36.40,1:19:40.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出港 千年號前進 第一戰速
Dialogue: 2,1:19:51.05,1:19:55.35,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻停船 千年號 立刻停船
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.26,1:19:54.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}奧布軍第二護衛艦隊導彈巡洋艦『義經』
Dialogue: 2,1:19:55.35,1:19:57.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如不遵從 我方將攻擊貴艦
Dialogue: 2,1:19:57.70,1:20:00.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,航路不變 兩舷第二戰速
Dialogue: 2,1:20:01.55,1:20:03.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.60,1:20:06.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,允許開火
Dialogue: 2,1:20:06.00,1:20:07.60,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,你明白的吧 隊長
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.98,1:20:12.61,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}「義經」艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.60,1:20:08.55,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:20:08.55,1:20:11.65,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,百發百偏可是戶高上校的親傳
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.65,1:20:13.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,開始射擊
Dialogue: 2,1:20:23.80,1:20:25.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是一場鬧劇
Dialogue: 2,1:20:25.95,1:20:30.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧布似乎無視了我們的警告
Dialogue: 2,1:20:30.25,1:20:34.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼 離回應時間應該還有剩餘的
Dialogue: 2,1:20:34.70,1:20:38.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們的議會正在商討你們的要求
Dialogue: 2,1:20:38.55,1:20:40.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,小動作太明顯了
Dialogue: 2,1:20:40.55,1:20:43.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們完全了解千年號的動向
Dialogue: 2,1:20:43.80,1:20:47.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,10分鐘後我們會向貴國發射「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:20:47.00,1:20:50.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 千年號被劫持了
Dialogue: 2,1:20:50.90,1:20:51.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,剛才P.L.A.N.T.這邊也…
Dialogue: 2,1:20:51.95,1:20:53.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我說過的
Dialogue: 2,1:20:53.25,1:20:55.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有一點動靜我們這邊就會射擊
Dialogue: 2,1:20:55.45,1:20:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是誤會
Dialogue: 2,1:20:56.45,1:20:58.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們完全沒有…
Dialogue: 2,1:20:58.55,1:21:03.21,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,不論早晚 反正是要攻擊他們的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(958,975)}奧布聯邦領袖國
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(1036,975)}首都
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.21,1:21:06.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1118,975)}歐羅法特
Dialogue: 2,1:21:03.21,1:21:08.67,Sub-CN - up,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,居民避難為優先事項 奧布軍全力進行支援
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.67,1:21:11.72,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(943,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}大規模災難地下避難設施『天之岩戶』
Dialogue: 2,1:21:08.67,1:21:11.70,Sub-CN - up,调轴-时间不对,0,0,0,,政府機構轉移至淤能碁呂島空中設施
Dialogue: 2,1:21:12.05,1:21:13.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐大人
Dialogue: 2,1:21:13.40,1:21:15.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快點 我們只有十分鐘
Dialogue: 2,1:21:19.10,1:21:21.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,動力最大 離水
Dialogue: 2,1:21:21.20,1:21:24.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主推進器 啟動
Dialogue: 2,1:21:25.02,1:21:26.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號 出發
Dialogue: 2,1:21:37.85,1:21:39.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.65,1:21:40.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盤王國…
Dialogue: 2,1:21:40.80,1:21:43.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」準備發射
Dialogue: 2,1:21:43.35,1:21:45.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目標是奧布首都歐羅法特
Dialogue: 2,1:21:45.95,1:21:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各位市民 請遵循誘導進行避難
Dialogue: 2,1:21:50.45,1:21:52.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,各位市民…
Dialogue: 2,1:21:52.25,1:21:54.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之後就拜託你們了 托亞
Dialogue: 2,1:21:54.50,1:21:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉姐姐大人 還請注意安全
Dialogue: 2,1:21:57.00,1:21:58.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請來這邊
Dialogue: 2,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯哈代表
Dialogue: 2,1:22:01.75,1:22:05.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嫣紅強襲 翔翼型已經為您準備好了
Dialogue: 2,1:22:05.15,1:22:05.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請盡快
Dialogue: 2,1:22:05.85,1:22:07.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 2,1:22:09.75,1:22:11.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然騙不過去啊
Dialogue: 2,1:22:11.95,1:22:15.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,對方從一開始就打算射擊奧布的
Dialogue: 2,1:22:15.20,1:22:17.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只要給他們藉口的話
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.91,1:22:22.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(988,975)}代理市長官邸內
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.91,1:22:22.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1020,975)}地下機艙
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.40,1:22:27.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,父親大人 請保護市民
Dialogue: 2,1:22:27.10,1:22:29.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:22:29.95,1:22:31.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,再見了 奧布
Dialogue: 2,1:22:31.70,1:22:34.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基盤王國 聽得到嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:22:34.15,1:22:36.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是千年號的基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.60,1:22:39.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,國際救援頻道傳來通訊
Dialogue: 2,1:22:39.35,1:22:40.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:22:40.40,1:22:44.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太可惜了 我還活著
Dialogue: 2,1:22:44.15,1:22:47.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明不惜犧牲自己的國民也要殺掉我
Dialogue: 2,1:22:47.95,1:22:49.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況 修拉
Dialogue: 2,1:22:49.40,1:22:51.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼會 竟然能在那種情況下活下來
Dialogue: 2,1:22:51.75,1:22:55.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們才不是什麼引導人類之人
Dialogue: 2,1:22:55.20,1:22:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只是殺人狂
Dialogue: 2,1:22:56.90,1:22:58.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們知道真相
Dialogue: 2,1:22:58.70,1:23:00.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,也有證據
Dialogue: 2,1:23:00.30,1:23:02.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們會將這件事告知全世界
Dialogue: 2,1:23:02.95,1:23:04.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是你們輸了
Dialogue: 2,1:23:04.90,1:23:06.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我才不管什麼超越者
Dialogue: 2,1:23:06.90,1:23:09.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是殺人狂的陰謀一定要挫敗
Dialogue: 2,1:23:09.70,1:23:11.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟敢說出這種話
Dialogue: 2,1:23:11.50,1:23:12.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母親大人
Dialogue: 2,1:23:12.50,1:23:14.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,幹掉那個廢物
Dialogue: 2,1:23:14.70,1:23:17.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」目標轉為千年號
Dialogue: 2,1:23:17.45,1:23:18.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 2,1:23:18.95,1:23:20.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是妾身的命令
Dialogue: 2,1:23:20.70,1:23:22.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,月亮背面傳來高能量反應
Dialogue: 2,1:23:22.70,1:23:23.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,陽電子炮唐懷瑟 啟動
Dialogue: 2,1:23:23.95,1:23:28.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,緊急煞車
Dialogue: 2,1:23:43.40,1:23:45.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 2,1:23:51.15,1:23:53.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,受電磁波影響 失去千年號信號
Dialogue: 2,1:23:53.75,1:23:54.29,Sub-CN,调轴-时间不对-适应画面跳转,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 2,1:23:56.15,1:23:57.90,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,傳令給全軍
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.42,1:24:02.39,Screen,-2,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,724)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}戰術戰略資訊綜合管制機『翔翼型』
Dialogue: 2,1:23:57.90,1:24:02.70,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,這之後我們將為保衛祖國行使我們的權利
Dialogue: 2,1:24:02.70,1:24:05.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,下達國土防衛指令
Dialogue: 2,1:24:05.10,1:24:07.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅盤理事國 千年號
Dialogue: 2,1:24:07.00,1:24:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,與永恆號構建戰術連結
Dialogue: 2,1:24:09.50,1:24:11.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,軍隊以保衛市民安全為最優先事項
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.85,1:24:14.25,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,立刻繼續引導市民避難
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:18.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1294,975)}超高速戰術強襲支援機『流星』07號機
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:18.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(737,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1334,975)}08號機
Dialogue: 2,1:24:19.30,1:24:22.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,儘管是換成了核動力
Dialogue: 2,1:24:22.10,1:24:25.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不過真虧他們保留了這麼老的機器啊
Dialogue: 2,1:24:25.40,1:24:27.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我倒是挺喜歡的
Dialogue: 2,1:24:27.45,1:24:29.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,扎古的控制系很順手
Dialogue: 2,1:24:29.80,1:24:30.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,伊扎克·玖爾
Dialogue: 2,1:24:30.85,1:24:32.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,決鬥 出發
Dialogue: 2,1:24:32.25,1:24:33.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迪亞哥·埃爾斯曼
Dialogue: 2,1:24:33.60,1:24:36.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,暴風 出發
Dialogue: 2,1:24:38.60,1:24:41.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 瑪琉小姐 我出發了
Dialogue: 2,1:24:41.35,1:24:44.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯 一定要把拉克絲帶回來
Dialogue: 2,1:24:44.05,1:24:46.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:24:46.35,1:24:48.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:24:48.80,1:24:51.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號就拜託你了
Dialogue: 2,1:24:53.70,1:24:54.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:24:54.90,1:24:56.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真好啊 那小子
Dialogue: 2,1:24:56.90,1:25:00.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為他很單純嘛
Dialogue: 2,1:25:00.05,1:25:02.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.65,1:25:05.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:25:10.15,1:25:11.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:25:11.40,1:25:12.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:12.65,1:25:17.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼公主大人不肯接受自己的命運
Dialogue: 2,1:25:17.65,1:25:19.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們被賜予了力量
Dialogue: 2,1:25:19.95,1:25:23.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,獲得了注定的使命後 才迎來了生命
Dialogue: 2,1:25:23.50,1:25:27.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遵從它 為他人所需要著
Dialogue: 2,1:25:27.15,1:25:30.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這才是我們的幸福吧
Dialogue: 2,1:25:30.15,1:25:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我覺得任何生命都有選擇自己生存道路的權利
Dialogue: 2,1:25:35.40,1:25:38.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這並不是我所期待的命運
Dialogue: 2,1:25:38.20,1:25:40.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這場紛爭不斷持續下去
Dialogue: 2,1:25:40.65,1:25:46.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家煩惱 迷茫 痛苦的樣子才是公主的願望嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:25:46.85,1:25:51.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,公主大人根本不明白自己有多幸運
Dialogue: 2,1:25:51.45,1:25:53.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明您可以將世界收入手中
Dialogue: 2,1:25:53.85,1:25:57.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼不接受奧費呢
Dialogue: 2,1:25:57.25,1:25:59.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你覺得這樣就好嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:26:02.70,1:26:04.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,冷靜下來了嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:26:04.70,1:26:07.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你也差不多該體會到自己的使命
Dialogue: 2,1:26:07.80,1:26:10.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,握住我的手了吧
Dialogue: 2,1:26:10.30,1:26:13.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,無論你問幾遍 我的答案都是一樣的
Dialogue: 2,1:26:13.10,1:26:16.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我所愛的人並不是你
Dialogue: 2,1:26:16.90,1:26:18.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和已經死了
Dialogue: 2,1:26:18.70,1:26:20.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 他並沒有死
Dialogue: 2,1:26:20.80,1:26:22.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你為什麼不肯接受現實
Dialogue: 2,1:26:22.90,1:26:25.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為我相信他
Dialogue: 2,1:26:28.65,1:26:29.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:26:29.75,1:26:31.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼是那種傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:26:31.00,1:26:33.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒能成為超越者的失敗品
Dialogue: 2,1:26:33.45,1:26:36.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為我已經決定要愛他了
Dialogue: 2,1:26:36.30,1:26:39.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所期待的事物 他沒有一點能做到
Dialogue: 2,1:26:39.70,1:26:41.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和平的世界也好
Dialogue: 2,1:26:41.20,1:26:44.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那樣的傢伙也有資格待在你身邊嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.05,1:26:46.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,愛不需要資格
Dialogue: 2,1:26:46.00,1:26:49.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你連這點都不明白嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:26:53.85,1:26:56.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算用蠻力讓對方屈服
Dialogue: 2,1:26:56.10,1:26:59.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,內心也絕對不會屈服
Dialogue: 2,1:26:59.05,1:27:04.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不管你做什麼 都沒辦法讓基拉消失在我心中
Dialogue: 2,1:27:04.95,1:27:06.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:27:06.65,1:27:09.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你生來就是為了與我一起統治世界的
Dialogue: 2,1:27:09.60,1:27:12.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可是為何不接受我
Dialogue: 2,1:27:12.05,1:27:13.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不接受我的愛
Dialogue: 2,1:27:13.50,1:27:19.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你所愛的拉克絲·克萊茵並不是我
Dialogue: 2,1:27:24.50,1:27:26.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要去月球
Dialogue: 2,1:27:26.90,1:27:29.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這邊的防衛就交給你和修拉了
Dialogue: 2,1:27:29.80,1:27:31.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:27:33.70,1:27:35.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,宰相大人前往艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:27:35.85,1:27:39.45,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,千年號和其餘敵對戰艦的動向如何
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.23,1:27:42.40,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}華納海姆級行星間航宇宙戰艦『古爾維格』艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.45,1:27:44.01,Sub-CN - up,调轴,0,0,0,,奧布艦隊和地球軍的殘存艦隊正在前往「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.01,1:27:47.14,Sub-CN,调轴,0,0,0,,預測將與扎夫特艦隊交戰
Dialogue: 2,1:27:47.85,1:27:50.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號正以最短路線襲來
Dialogue: 2,1:27:50.65,1:27:53.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,離與我軍交戰時間約為4分
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.25,1:27:55.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全艦展開鶴翼陣型
Dialogue: 2,1:27:55.75,1:27:58.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,後退 和對方保持相對速度
Dialogue: 2,1:27:58.15,1:28:01.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,十二連陽電子炮 瞄準敵艦前進路線
Dialogue: 2,1:28:01.75,1:28:04.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,遮擋艦橋 轉為第一戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 2,1:28:04.60,1:28:06.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,按照這個陣型來的話
Dialogue: 2,1:28:06.30,1:28:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們用不了陽電子炮啊
Dialogue: 2,1:28:09.40,1:28:11.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒事的 我們有新兵器
Dialogue: 2,1:28:11.80,1:28:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,展開耐熱耐衝擊結晶裝甲
Dialogue: 2,1:28:20.00,1:28:22.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,實行巴基露露戰術
Dialogue: 2,1:28:22.35,1:28:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,導彈發射時間 輸入完成
Dialogue: 2,1:28:25.80,1:28:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射反光束爆雷
Dialogue: 2,1:28:29.05,1:28:30.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啟動收束火線炮 近迫武器系統
Dialogue: 2,1:28:30.80,1:28:34.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,導彈發射器狀態宇宙用導彈和迎擊導彈
Dialogue: 2,1:28:34.25,1:28:36.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,以最大航速正面突破
Dialogue: 2,1:28:36.95,1:28:38.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,開火
Dialogue: 2,1:28:45.50,1:28:47.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,甚至不進行迴避
Dialogue: 2,1:28:47.10,1:28:49.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迎擊導彈 近迫武器系統
Dialogue: 2,1:28:49.20,1:28:51.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,開始發射
Dialogue: 2,1:28:53.10,1:28:54.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們能頂住嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:28:54.30,1:28:56.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是當然的
Dialogue: 2,1:29:02.90,1:29:05.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還挺能幹的啊 賊子們
Dialogue: 2,1:29:05.20,1:29:08.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,將超高速對艦誘導彈亂射至敵人航路前方
Dialogue: 2,1:29:08.90,1:29:13.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全艦調頭 全速追擊敵人
Dialogue: 2,1:29:13.15,1:29:16.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,超高速導彈正在接近 正在追擊
Dialogue: 2,1:29:16.15,1:29:18.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵艦隊正在轉頭
Dialogue: 2,1:29:18.95,1:29:20.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射迎擊導彈
Dialogue: 2,1:29:20.40,1:29:22.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦隊轉頭180度
Dialogue: 2,1:29:22.70,1:29:25.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,向左飄移 保持相對速度
Dialogue: 2,1:29:25.80,1:29:28.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全體MS出發
Dialogue: 2,1:29:38.85,1:29:40.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,連接發射器
Dialogue: 2,1:29:40.50,1:29:41.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系統全部上線
Dialogue: 2,1:29:41.80,1:29:45.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,超電容系統 1號到10號到達界限
Dialogue: 2,1:29:45.60,1:29:47.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引導系統 無異常
Dialogue: 2,1:29:47.55,1:29:51.27,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,路線已清空 Destiny 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:29:51.29,1:29:54.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真·飛鳥  Destiny 出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:29:54.80,1:29:57.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,脈衝 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:29:57.00,1:30:00.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜瑪麗亞·霍克 脈衝出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:00.45,1:30:03.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,勇士 請出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:03.10,1:30:06.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,希爾達·哈肯 勇士 出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:06.70,1:30:09.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我要登上戰鬥艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:30:09.05,1:30:10.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之後就拜託你了
Dialogue: 2,1:30:10.95,1:30:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,祝您武運昌隆
Dialogue: 2,1:30:12.15,1:30:15.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,主艦橋 轉為戰鬥模式
Dialogue: 2,1:30:15.05,1:30:16.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引導系統上線
Dialogue: 2,1:30:16.90,1:30:20.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全裝甲 發射
Dialogue: 2,1:30:34.80,1:30:36.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵艦發射MS
Dialogue: 2,1:30:36.55,1:30:37.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,數量為3
Dialogue: 2,1:30:37.50,1:30:38.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,迎擊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:38.30,1:30:40.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 等等
Dialogue: 2,1:30:40.20,1:30:41.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和在哪裡
Dialogue: 2,1:30:44.00,1:30:46.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有MS接近 數量為1
Dialogue: 2,1:30:46.80,1:30:48.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:30:48.55,1:30:50.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼他知道這裡
Dialogue: 2,1:30:50.80,1:30:54.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是為了救公主僅僅只派出一台
Dialogue: 2,1:30:54.40,1:30:56.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還真令人淚目啊
Dialogue: 2,1:30:56.20,1:30:57.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉
Dialogue: 2,1:30:57.15,1:30:59.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,如此用派多人來應對便是愚蠢
Dialogue: 2,1:30:59.90,1:31:01.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我來應對
Dialogue: 2,1:31:01.40,1:31:05.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,將他愚蠢的願望擊碎到體無完膚吧
Dialogue: 2,1:31:05.80,1:31:07.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 2,1:31:08.70,1:31:10.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:31:10.10,1:31:11.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:31:11.65,1:31:14.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這種心神不寧的感覺是什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:31:14.75,1:31:18.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但也不能隨便分散戰力
Dialogue: 2,1:31:18.25,1:31:20.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,MS隊 出動
Dialogue: 2,1:31:20.05,1:31:22.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,殲滅敵人
Dialogue: 2,1:31:22.90,1:31:24.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟然是Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:31:24.50,1:31:26.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還真是愛亂來
Dialogue: 2,1:31:26.40,1:31:29.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,還算有點斬殺的價值吧
Dialogue: 2,1:31:29.05,1:31:32.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正好夠我們來訓練軍隊
Dialogue: 2,1:31:38.55,1:31:41.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別小看我
Dialogue: 2,1:31:43.70,1:31:47.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算是我也
Dialogue: 2,1:32:14.45,1:32:17.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這回不會失手了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(1136,975)}基盤王國衛星基地內
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.76,1:32:24.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(1166,975)}艦船艙
Dialogue: 2,1:32:31.45,1:32:33.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防衛線的內側出現突破口
Dialogue: 2,1:32:33.90,1:32:36.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我來處理
Dialogue: 2,1:32:50.70,1:32:52.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快點快點快點
Dialogue: 2,1:32:52.85,1:32:55.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,強制封鎖所有隔離牆
Dialogue: 2,1:33:02.05,1:33:05.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我不懂 為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:33:06.65,1:33:08.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不想承認
Dialogue: 2,1:33:08.25,1:33:09.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,來走這邊
Dialogue: 2,1:33:09.50,1:33:10.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奇薩卡上校
Dialogue: 2,1:33:10.80,1:33:12.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們上
Dialogue: 2,1:33:12.15,1:33:15.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈羅哈羅
Dialogue: 2,1:33:15.20,1:33:17.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 2,1:33:17.80,1:33:21.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,狀態極佳
Dialogue: 2,1:33:21.15,1:33:23.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不行 控制權被奪走了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:23.30,1:33:25.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,系統當機了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:25.05,1:33:27.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在做什麼啊 把修拉叫回來
Dialogue: 2,1:33:27.95,1:33:30.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,無法通訊
Dialogue: 2,1:33:40.45,1:33:43.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉 有敵人入侵了
Dialogue: 2,1:33:43.30,1:33:46.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,托利
Dialogue: 2,1:33:53.60,1:33:55.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:33:57.30,1:33:59.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是阿斯蘭·薩拉吧
Dialogue: 2,1:33:59.05,1:34:02.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不是能讀心嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:34:02.15,1:34:04.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真沒用啊
Dialogue: 2,1:34:04.35,1:34:06.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我殺了你
Dialogue: 2,1:34:14.50,1:34:17.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,絕對不能把你交出去
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.60,1:34:20.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是基拉來了吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:20.20,1:34:22.75,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你在高興什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:34:22.75,1:34:26.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們也是因為有你在就能在戰場上取得有利地位
Dialogue: 2,1:34:26.10,1:34:28.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才冒險來爭奪你的
Dialogue: 2,1:34:28.85,1:34:30.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就只是因為這點吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:30.55,1:34:32.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:34:32.10,1:34:33.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧費也是
Dialogue: 2,1:34:33.30,1:34:37.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就因為你比較優秀 所以才愛你
Dialogue: 2,1:34:37.25,1:34:39.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大家都是如此吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:39.20,1:34:40.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想要更優秀的東西
Dialogue: 2,1:34:40.60,1:34:42.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,想放在身邊
Dialogue: 2,1:34:42.30,1:34:45.05,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有這樣的價值才會需要
Dialogue: 2,1:34:45.05,1:34:46.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才會被愛吧
Dialogue: 2,1:34:46.65,1:34:50.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那真的是愛嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.95,1:34:52.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:34:52.15,1:34:54.35,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:34:55.00,1:34:56.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別過來
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.65,1:35:00.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敢動一下我就弄瞎她
Dialogue: 2,1:35:00.65,1:35:02.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,毀掉嗓子也可以
Dialogue: 2,1:35:02.55,1:35:06.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能再歌唱的這個人 你還能說愛她嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.85,1:35:11.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 就算她目不能視 口不能言
Dialogue: 2,1:35:11.00,1:35:12.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲也是拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:35:12.85,1:35:15.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我愛她的全部
Dialogue: 2,1:35:15.15,1:35:17.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:17.10,1:35:20.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,才不是因為需要才愛
Dialogue: 2,1:35:20.55,1:35:24.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為愛所以才需要
Dialogue: 2,1:35:41.60,1:35:43.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:43.00,1:35:44.85,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:35:44.85,1:35:46.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你太亂來了
Dialogue: 2,1:35:46.30,1:35:50.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也愛你
Dialogue: 2,1:35:53.55,1:35:55.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 2,1:35:55.30,1:35:56.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 2,1:36:20.24,1:36:22.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲就拜託你了 我要去「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:23.10,1:36:25.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們很強 要小心
Dialogue: 2,1:36:25.52,1:36:26.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:36:26.17,1:36:27.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這次我不會輸了
Dialogue: 2,1:36:27.73,1:36:29.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為我不是一個人
Dialogue: 2,1:36:29.90,1:36:30.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:36:30.94,1:36:32.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請一定要當心
Dialogue: 2,1:36:32.61,1:36:33.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:36:40.14,1:36:43.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,偏向連結11號 已移動至初始點
Dialogue: 2,1:36:43.66,1:36:45.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:45.13,1:36:46.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,燒盡奧布
Dialogue: 2,1:36:46.43,1:36:48.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是 發射「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:36:48.56,1:36:50.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目標 奧布首都歐爾法特
Dialogue: 2,1:36:50.45,1:36:54.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,接受你所作所為的報應吧 基拉·大和
Dialogue: 2,1:36:54.26,1:36:56.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」發射10秒前
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.38,1:37:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,9 8 7 6 5
Dialogue: 2,1:37:07.47,1:37:09.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修正垂直軸線誤差
Dialogue: 2,1:37:09.39,1:37:10.86,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射電壓已到達臨界值
Dialogue: 2,1:37:10.86,1:37:13.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」發射口附近出現MS
Dialogue: 2,1:37:13.82,1:37:14.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:37:16.50,1:37:17.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 2,1:37:40.86,1:37:41.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,穆
Dialogue: 2,1:37:43.84,1:37:47.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀 把不可能化為可能還真是辛苦啊
Dialogue: 2,1:37:47.63,1:37:50.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,上校   太好了
Dialogue: 2,1:37:52.33,1:37:54.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一級中繼點 受到攻擊後消失
Dialogue: 2,1:37:54.68,1:37:57.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,偏向連結設置用艦 不可航行
Dialogue: 2,1:37:57.08,1:37:58.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」外殼損傷
Dialogue: 2,1:37:58.82,1:38:00.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,光束發射系統損傷
Dialogue: 2,1:38:00.63,1:38:02.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有熱源正接近「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:38:02.43,1:38:04.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,立刻進行修復
Dialogue: 2,1:38:04.62,1:38:06.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惡的舊人類們
Dialogue: 2,1:38:07.51,1:38:08.31,Sub-CN,调轴-适配屏字,0,0,0,,解除偽裝
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.31,1:38:10.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}奧布軍第一宇宙艦隊戰艦『草薙』
Dialogue: 2,1:38:09.35,1:38:11.76,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,目標是鎮壓「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.02,1:38:13.44,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(888,975)}同
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.02,1:38:13.44,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(924,975)}艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:38:11.76,1:38:13.41,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,或者全部破壞
Dialogue: 2,1:38:13.81,1:38:15.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全機可自由使用武器
Dialogue: 2,1:38:15.97,1:38:19.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,決不輕饒將死之獠牙朝向奧布之人
Dialogue: 2,1:38:27.70,1:38:29.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,MS隊 躲開射線軸
Dialogue: 2,1:38:30.60,1:38:32.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,羅恩格林 發射
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.42,1:38:37.59,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(912,975)}地球聯合軍
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.42,1:38:37.59,Screen,没翻,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(948,975)}基地
Dialogue: 2,1:38:38.52,1:38:39.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,分離誘導炮
Dialogue: 2,1:38:40.29,1:38:42.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,收束火線炮 1號 2號
Dialogue: 2,1:38:42.01,1:38:42.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,磁軌炮
Dialogue: 2,1:38:44.04,1:38:45.77,Sub-CN,调轴+断句,0,0,0,,目標 敵戰艦
Dialogue: 2,1:38:46.50,1:38:47.39,Sub-CN,调轴+断句,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 2,1:39:02.29,1:39:03.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,黑騎士小隊要來了
Dialogue: 2,1:39:04.32,1:39:05.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,光束不管用
Dialogue: 2,1:39:05.61,1:39:06.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜負責掩護
Dialogue: 2,1:39:15.99,1:39:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我們也有對艦刀 我也能用
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.38,1:39:31.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是不會吸取教訓的笨蛋
Dialogue: 2,1:39:31.07,1:39:33.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們是贏不了我們的
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.34,1:39:34.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,再把你們打掉
Dialogue: 2,1:39:44.93,1:39:46.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不會讓你們接近千年號的
Dialogue: 2,1:39:49.23,1:39:50.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那台MS…
Dialogue: 2,1:39:52.99,1:39:54.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲 為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:39:54.52,1:39:56.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,脈衝 是露娜瑪麗亞
Dialogue: 2,1:39:56.77,1:39:58.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿格尼絲 你還活著啊
Dialogue: 2,1:39:59.13,1:40:01.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,只有修拉才明白我的價值
Dialogue: 2,1:40:07.87,1:40:09.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你只是被利用了
Dialogue: 2,1:40:09.52,1:40:10.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這都不明白?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:10.53,1:40:12.67,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你不也是調整者
Dialogue: 2,1:40:12.67,1:40:14.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼站在他們那邊?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:14.76,1:40:16.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,受到那個蠢男人的影響
Dialogue: 2,1:40:16.34,1:40:17.76,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,腦子壞掉了嗎?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:17.76,1:40:20.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,蛤? 這跟真有什麼關係
Dialogue: 2,1:40:20.49,1:40:23.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你才是得不到隊長的關注才…
Dialogue: 2,1:40:23.19,1:40:25.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,閉嘴!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.22,1:40:38.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 這傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:40:38.69,1:40:41.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,之前是因為駕駛Justice才輸的
Dialogue: 2,1:40:41.54,1:40:42.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,換上Destiny
Dialogue: 2,1:40:42.69,1:40:44.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,區區你們這種傢伙!
Dialogue: 2,1:40:55.23,1:40:56.45,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看不到對方在想什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:40:56.45,1:40:58.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這傢伙 什麼都不思考的嗎?
Dialogue: 2,1:41:02.78,1:41:04.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一個都不許放過去
Dialogue: 2,1:41:04.46,1:41:06.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不過是一群自然人的烏合之眾
Dialogue: 2,1:41:06.78,1:41:08.66,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,漢密爾頓 謝克特 擊沉
Dialogue: 2,1:41:09.13,1:41:10.63,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵方MS接近
Dialogue: 2,1:41:16.88,1:41:19.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,賈格納特中校 P.L.A.N.T.的來信
Dialogue: 2,1:41:20.83,1:41:25.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,議長呼籲軍隊停止攻擊 並鎮壓政變
Dialogue: 2,1:41:25.26,1:41:26.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼?!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:28.07,1:41:31.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,506呼叫CP 目標投降  已解除武裝
Dialogue: 2,1:41:31.72,1:41:35.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,CP收到  繼續注意IED
Dialogue: 2,1:41:35.16,1:41:36.33,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,505呼叫CP…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.73,1:41:38.65,Screen,去掉了P.L.A.N.T.的点 如果是专有校对再加上,0,0,0,,{\fsp0\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an3\pos(884,975)}P.L.A.N.T.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.73,1:41:38.65,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an1\pos(920,975)}國防總部大樓
Dialogue: 2,1:41:36.33,1:41:38.01,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,繼續攻擊
Dialogue: 2,1:41:38.01,1:41:39.85,Sub-CN - up,调轴,0,0,0,,只要「鎮魂曲」攻擊了奧布
Dialogue: 2,1:41:39.85,1:41:40.69,Sub-CN,调轴-画面跳转,0,0,0,,時代就會改變!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:46.23,1:41:47.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,控制損傷
Dialogue: 2,1:41:58.96,1:42:00.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這邊是扎夫特軍情報處
Dialogue: 2,1:42:00.78,1:42:02.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,伊扎克·玖爾中校
Dialogue: 2,1:42:02.61,1:42:04.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,傳達軍隊總部命令
Dialogue: 2,1:42:05.11,1:42:10.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,賈格納特中校旗下的扎夫特軍隊 立刻停戰 返回原部隊
Dialogue: 2,1:42:20.18,1:42:20.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 2,1:42:22.46,1:42:24.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號 是我
Dialogue: 2,1:42:24.49,1:42:26.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,請立刻準備進行廣播
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.61,1:42:29.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲大人 歡迎回來
Dialogue: 2,1:42:32.48,1:42:35.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,賈格納特中校  你想被控叛國罪嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:42:35.54,1:42:40.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這不是反叛  我們才是手握P.L.A.N.T.未來的人
Dialogue: 2,1:42:40.03,1:42:41.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲·克萊茵
Dialogue: 2,1:42:42.78,1:42:45.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,剛剛逃離了基盤王國的監禁
Dialogue: 2,1:42:46.28,1:42:48.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在向大家對話
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.51,1:42:53.47,Screen,2,0,0,0,,{\fad(1069,0)\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}千年號航行艦橋
Dialogue: 2,1:42:48.72,1:42:53.52,Sub-CN - up,,0,0,0,,首先 我絕不贊同對基盤王國的意見
Dialogue: 2,1:42:54.26,1:42:59.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,他們所謂公正平等的社會 是置於命運計劃的統治下
Dialogue: 2,1:43:00.31,1:43:04.94,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正如我曾經所言  這是完全無法接受的
Dialogue: 2,1:43:05.94,1:43:11.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,無論失敗 變化還是夢想 一切都不被允許的世界
Dialogue: 2,1:43:12.47,1:43:14.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人的價值由基因決定的社會
Dialogue: 2,1:43:15.43,1:43:19.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的價值不能交友別人決定
Dialogue: 2,1:43:19.99,1:43:24.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,更不能透過暴力或恐怖來強迫別人
Dialogue: 2,1:43:24.46,1:43:26.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是絕不可容忍的
Dialogue: 2,1:43:27.94,1:43:32.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,任何生命都有決定自己命運的自由
Dialogue: 2,1:43:32.95,1:43:35.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也會為此而戰
Dialogue: 2,1:43:36.61,1:43:42.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,永遠不要讓不愛你的人來決定你的價值
Dialogue: 2,1:43:47.44,1:43:48.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能再讓你們繼續下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.32,1:43:52.74,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1\bord2\shad0\blur5\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fs50\fn方正中雅宋_GBK\an2\pos(960,975)}機動要塞『彌賽亞』墜落遺跡
Dialogue: 2,1:43:52.90,1:43:56.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不能完成任務 我們就沒有活著的意義
Dialogue: 2,1:43:56.06,1:43:57.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵艦隊千年號接近
Dialogue: 2,1:43:57.95,1:44:00.76,Sub-CN,为什么是全角英语字符,0,0,0,,M1A1修拉與X20A交戰中
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.76,1:44:02.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,旗艦 艦隊向「鎮魂曲」前進
Dialogue: 2,1:44:03.11,1:44:07.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,將千年號號引入艦隊防禦線內殲滅
Dialogue: 2,1:44:07.93,1:44:12.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,母親 接下來就拜託你了 我和修拉去解決Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:44:13.40,1:44:14.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出發 英格利特
Dialogue: 2,1:44:15.33,1:44:20.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,本艦將突破敵艦隊衝向敵旗艦 決戰
Dialogue: 2,1:44:20.65,1:44:21.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 2,1:44:22.64,1:44:23.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:44:24.15,1:44:26.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也出擊 請允許
Dialogue: 2,1:44:28.12,1:44:29.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,必須將這個交給基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:44:30.37,1:44:32.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是我的責任
Dialogue: 2,1:44:33.44,1:44:34.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是 這…
Dialogue: 2,1:44:34.72,1:44:35.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 2,1:44:35.93,1:44:37.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這次請讓我去吧
Dialogue: 2,1:44:37.88,1:44:39.41,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,總裁 這裡是艾伯特
Dialogue: 2,1:44:39.75,1:44:41.95,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,機體可以以100％的性能運作
Dialogue: 2,1:44:41.95,1:44:44.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但對接需要按照手冊微調
Dialogue: 2,1:44:44.51,1:44:46.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我會完美的引導 請放心
Dialogue: 2,1:44:47.60,1:44:50.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了 允許發射
Dialogue: 2,1:44:50.62,1:44:51.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 2,1:44:52.74,1:44:53.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 2,1:44:53.96,1:44:58.82,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這樣也好 有時候只能在一旁看反而會更痛苦
Dialogue: 2,1:45:00.35,1:45:02.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,騎士 起飛
Dialogue: 2,1:45:02.07,1:45:04.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭·薩拉　魔蟹出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:45:08.17,1:45:10.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,防衛者 出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:45:10.07,1:45:11.78,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲·克萊茵 出擊
Dialogue: 2,1:45:21.80,1:45:24.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你們也證明一下自己的價值
Dialogue: 2,1:45:25.07,1:45:26.09,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:26.09,1:45:26.77,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 2,1:45:36.88,1:45:38.53,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,投降吧 中校
Dialogue: 2,1:45:38.53,1:45:40.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,國內的政變也失敗了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:40.38,1:45:41.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別再讓士兵白白送死了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:42.39,1:45:44.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼與舊世界的人為伍
Dialogue: 2,1:45:45.20,1:45:47.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這樣下去 什麼都改變不了
Dialogue: 2,1:45:47.89,1:45:52.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,一部分人富有 豪橫地行使不合理和不道德的權力的世界
Dialogue: 2,1:45:52.53,1:45:54.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,生錯時代的愚蠢者們
Dialogue: 2,1:46:03.78,1:46:05.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已經堅持不住了 伊扎克
Dialogue: 2,1:46:05.50,1:46:08.55,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,說服有用的話  我們就不用做這種事情了
Dialogue: 2,1:46:08.55,1:46:09.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 2,1:46:13.54,1:46:14.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,開火
Dialogue: 2,1:46:33.26,1:46:34.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可憐的傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:46:34.60,1:46:35.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:46:37.05,1:46:39.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,舊式的MS也想向我們挑戰
Dialogue: 2,1:46:46.65,1:46:49.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,強弱又不是由高達的性能決定
Dialogue: 2,1:46:54.03,1:46:58.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正是如此  你這個不及我們的傢伙不可能取勝
Dialogue: 2,1:47:06.03,1:47:07.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但是我也有我的武器
Dialogue: 2,1:47:08.23,1:47:09.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那是 什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:47:12.31,1:47:13.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲的愛
Dialogue: 2,1:47:17.92,1:47:19.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 2,1:47:22.23,1:47:23.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,骯髒
Dialogue: 2,1:47:24.12,1:47:27.73,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,像你這樣的垃圾還敢提拉克絲的名字
Dialogue: 2,1:47:27.73,1:47:30.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,死上百萬次也無法消除那罪孽
Dialogue: 2,1:47:46.60,1:47:48.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊 真
Dialogue: 2,1:47:49.90,1:47:50.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 2,1:48:03.69,1:48:04.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 2,1:48:04.72,1:48:05.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:48:06.60,1:48:08.68,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,發射雙重粒子束
Dialogue: 2,1:48:14.77,1:48:15.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真難纏
Dialogue: 2,1:48:16.29,1:48:17.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,劉 丹尼爾
Dialogue: 2,1:48:17.46,1:48:18.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 2,1:48:18.17,1:48:20.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,結束了 廢物
Dialogue: 2,1:48:28.75,1:48:32.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,從以前就開始對別人的男朋友動手動腳的
Dialogue: 2,1:48:32.47,1:48:38.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這有什麼錯 畢竟男人都應該喜歡我 別妒忌我
Dialogue: 2,1:48:43.89,1:48:48.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼要來阻擋我  什麼都做不到的失敗的你
Dialogue: 2,1:48:52.05,1:48:54.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你根本就不該出生
Dialogue: 2,1:48:54.55,1:48:57.19,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,反而你還幸福地活著 被愛著
Dialogue: 2,1:48:58.28,1:49:00.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,明明就沒有那種資格
Dialogue: 2,1:49:02.17,1:49:05.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被愛並不需要資格
Dialogue: 2,1:49:06.16,1:49:13.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼 把那份愛交給我 她應該是我的 可是你卻……
Dialogue: 2,1:49:27.47,1:49:29.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,結束了 Freedom
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.01,1:49:34.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:49:38.62,1:49:39.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 2,1:49:55.80,1:49:56.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:49:57.38,1:49:58.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒事吧 基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:49:58.88,1:49:59.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 2,1:49:59.83,1:50:00.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 2,1:50:00.69,1:50:01.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 2,1:50:03.20,1:50:04.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,進行對接
Dialogue: 2,1:50:06.13,1:50:09.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,集中火力  對Freedom進行致命一擊
Dialogue: 2,1:50:13.09,1:50:16.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,相對速度+1.2  軸線修正+3
Dialogue: 2,1:50:16.47,1:50:17.22,Sub-CN,在线文档没这个了,0,0,0,,連接
Dialogue: 2,1:50:36.42,1:50:36.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:50:54.65,1:50:55.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,有趣
Dialogue: 2,1:50:58.36,1:51:00.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,拉克絲 為什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:51:00.53,1:51:03.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的意志將與你同在
Dialogue: 2,1:51:04.20,1:51:06.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,今後永遠 請多關照
Dialogue: 2,1:51:07.60,1:51:08.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,要上囉
Dialogue: 2,1:51:08.38,1:51:09.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 2,1:51:11.17,1:51:13.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,竟然不惜如此也要拒絕我…
Dialogue: 2,1:51:15.88,1:51:19.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼就讓你那愚蠢的愛情一起滅亡吧
Dialogue: 2,1:51:27.59,1:51:28.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這是 我的…
Dialogue: 2,1:51:50.08,1:51:51.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事 那個武器
Dialogue: 2,1:51:51.90,1:51:52.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,使用干擾器
Dialogue: 2,1:51:53.29,1:51:56.46,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,基拉·大和准將申請使用粉碎炮
Dialogue: 2,1:51:56.46,1:52:00.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,總裁 拉克絲·克萊茵 准許使用
Dialogue: 2,1:52:00.18,1:52:02.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,粉碎炮啟動 輸出80%
Dialogue: 2,1:52:02.90,1:52:07.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵人在彌賽亞的陰影中 與我的意識相連
Dialogue: 2,1:52:18.39,1:52:23.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」的修理結束 偏向環正向第一級中繼點移動中
Dialogue: 2,1:52:23.70,1:52:28.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,準備好就向奧布攻擊 敵艦隊也一起
Dialogue: 2,1:52:29.04,1:52:31.60,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,同步攻擊 出發吧
Dialogue: 2,1:52:31.60,1:52:32.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.72,1:52:34.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,落入黑暗吧
Dialogue: 2,1:52:38.50,1:52:40.79,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真由我保護
Dialogue: 2,1:52:45.94,1:52:47.18,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這傢伙的黑暗…
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.62,1:52:48.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,太深了
Dialogue: 2,1:52:54.63,1:52:57.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那傢伙消失了 不可能
Dialogue: 2,1:52:58.61,1:53:02.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那種迷糊的分身能奏效嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:53:04.45,1:53:06.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,這種武器 我怎麼不知道
Dialogue: 2,1:53:07.38,1:53:11.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,分身是這樣的
Dialogue: 2,1:53:14.20,1:53:15.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 2,1:53:17.46,1:53:19.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那群傢伙的仇
Dialogue: 2,1:53:23.34,1:53:24.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,麗德爾
Dialogue: 2,1:53:24.25,1:53:25.20,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:25.20,1:53:26.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 2,1:53:44.43,1:53:46.31,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我的孩子們…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:46.84,1:53:47.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 2,1:53:48.33,1:53:51.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,無論奧布也好P.L.A.N.T.也好都燒成灰燼
Dialogue: 2,1:53:52.33,1:53:56.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為什麼總是我 什麼事情都不順利
Dialogue: 2,1:53:57.16,1:53:59.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你是認真的嗎
Dialogue: 2,1:53:59.11,1:54:04.43,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,和根本不喜歡的矮醜男交往 應該過得很幸福吧
Dialogue: 2,1:54:06.30,1:54:09.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哈 喜歡又怎樣 有意見?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:09.76,1:54:12.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不會吧 真喜歡 那樣的山猴
Dialogue: 2,1:54:13.98,1:54:17.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,多管閒事 不喜歡為什麼要交往
Dialogue: 2,1:54:18.03,1:54:20.87,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也值得被愛啊
Dialogue: 2,1:54:20.87,1:54:22.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 又怎樣
Dialogue: 2,1:54:29.24,1:54:31.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我也喜歡…
Dialogue: 2,1:54:32.17,1:54:33.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿格尼絲
Dialogue: 2,1:54:35.13,1:54:37.21,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,陽電子炮唐懷瑟  發射
Dialogue: 2,1:54:43.11,1:54:45.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是現在 兩舷全速!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:45.07,1:54:47.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,敵艦主炮射程 31到65
Dialogue: 2,1:54:47.81,1:54:49.88,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,目標 敵旗艦!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:49.88,1:54:51.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使撞上也要擊落!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:53.26,1:54:58.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,絕不會忘記!死者流下的血淚 憎恨!
Dialogue: 2,1:54:58.37,1:55:00.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,絕不忘記
Dialogue: 2,1:55:03.44,1:55:04.72,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒有忘記…
Dialogue: 2,1:55:17.94,1:55:21.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,正因如此 我們必須停止這種事情…
Dialogue: 2,1:55:27.92,1:55:30.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你很強 阿斯蘭·薩拉
Dialogue: 2,1:55:32.97,1:55:35.15,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但 還不是我的對手
Dialogue: 2,1:55:35.60,1:55:40.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,勝利是我被賦予的使命 這就是我的存在意義!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:42.06,1:55:44.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,沒用的 你無法關閉思考!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:46.25,1:55:47.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 2,1:55:52.56,1:55:58.56,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙 在神聖的戰場競有如此不知羞恥的妄想!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:00.89,1:56:01.48,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看到了!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:03.65,1:56:04.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:07.89,1:56:09.37,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能 為什麼!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:09.77,1:56:11.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是無用的東西
Dialogue: 2,1:56:18.38,1:56:19.99,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是遠端操作嗎!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:20.72,1:56:22.33,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不知羞恥的妄想?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:23.21,1:56:24.39,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 2,1:56:24.39,1:56:26.29,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卑鄙的傢伙!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:30.12,1:56:32.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,果然還是我更勝一籌!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:32.06,1:56:35.13,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,強大不在於力量 而是生存的意志!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:39.72,1:56:41.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我會輸?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:48.70,1:56:50.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧費  修拉!
Dialogue: 2,1:56:50.25,1:56:51.11,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,修拉…
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.52,1:56:54.06,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,可惡 卑微的蟲子們…
Dialogue: 2,1:56:54.06,1:56:56.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧費 英格利特 放棄吧
Dialogue: 2,1:56:57.49,1:57:00.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你選擇那個男人 是因為你覺得他不如你
Dialogue: 2,1:57:01.33,1:57:05.16,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被比劣等的人包圍著崇拜著 真的那麼讓你高興嗎!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:06.16,1:57:08.34,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真是個自私又冷酷的女人!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:08.34,1:57:12.49,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就算那些傻瓜們不停戰鬥到自取滅亡也完全不在意嗎?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:22.86,1:57:23.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 2,1:57:23.70,1:57:25.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,毀掉「鎮魂曲」
Dialogue: 2,1:57:25.40,1:57:26.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,小子
Dialogue: 2,1:57:26.22,1:57:26.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 2,1:57:27.45,1:57:30.07,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,什麼大叔 拿上你的裝備
Dialogue: 2,1:57:30.07,1:57:30.93,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 2,1:57:30.93,1:57:32.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,露娜瑪麗亞使用這個
Dialogue: 2,1:57:35.99,1:57:37.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,出發 露娜!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:38.77,1:57:39.74,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,隨時準備!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:43.16,1:57:44.65,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,千年號接近
Dialogue: 2,1:57:44.65,1:57:47.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,哎 擊落他
Dialogue: 2,1:57:47.17,1:57:48.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,「鎮魂曲」準備好了嗎?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:48.71,1:57:51.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,距離發射還剩300秒!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:51.94,1:57:53.22,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,突破!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:53.22,1:57:55.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,艦首沖角 轟天 啟動!
Dialogue: 2,1:57:55.62,1:57:57.91,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所有炮門 近距離裝彈!
Dialogue: 2,1:58:00.55,1:58:02.83,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,全體成員 預備衝擊
Dialogue: 2,1:58:12.00,1:58:14.71,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,生命沒有高低之分
Dialogue: 2,1:58:15.31,1:58:18.51,Sub-CN,存在,0,0,0,,誰都是另一個人珍貴的存在
Dialogue: 2,1:58:19.10,1:58:21.40,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,那麼 為什麼我沒有被愛
Dialogue: 2,1:58:21.40,1:58:24.81,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不 一定有誰注視著你
Dialogue: 2,1:58:25.44,1:58:28.47,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使不是現在 但是在未來的某個人
Dialogue: 2,1:58:28.47,1:58:31.90,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,近在咫尺而沒有發現的
Dialogue: 2,1:58:36.82,1:58:40.38,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,未來怎麼都好 我只想要現在的你
Dialogue: 2,1:58:41.26,1:58:43.26,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為人類的愚蠢 我們才誕生了…
Dialogue: 2,1:58:43.95,1:58:48.04,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,口頭上說著和平與平等 卻要求他人改變
Dialogue: 2,1:58:48.04,1:58:49.89,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,卻從不自己努力改變
Dialogue: 2,1:58:50.75,1:58:52.17,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,並非如此
Dialogue: 2,1:58:52.68,1:58:55.08,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以無論什麼時代紛爭都未停息
Dialogue: 2,1:58:55.55,1:58:58.54,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使瀕臨滅亡也不忘恨
Dialogue: 2,1:58:59.00,1:59:01.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,被眼前的得失和固執的看法所左右
Dialogue: 2,1:59:01.51,1:59:02.80,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,互相拖後腿
Dialogue: 2,1:59:03.30,1:59:04.62,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所有人都是愚蠢的傢伙
Dialogue: 2,1:59:05.43,1:59:06.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,奧費
Dialogue: 2,1:59:06.98,1:59:08.98,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,引導者不可或缺
Dialogue: 2,1:59:09.41,1:59:12.00,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,結束這分裂和流血的歷史
Dialogue: 2,1:59:12.43,1:59:14.57,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,就是我們誕生的意義
Dialogue: 2,1:59:14.57,1:59:17.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,人不是需要才誕生
Dialogue: 2,1:59:19.15,1:59:20.70,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,因為愛才誕生
Dialogue: 2,1:59:22.82,1:59:25.50,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我將用自己的手 抉擇未來
Dialogue: 2,1:59:46.52,1:59:47.69,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,開火
Dialogue: 2,1:59:56.27,2:00:00.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,不可能 我還有使命…
Dialogue: 2,2:00:00.86,2:00:03.10,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,已經足夠了 奧費
Dialogue: 2,2:00:04.06,2:00:05.03,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,英格利特
Dialogue: 2,2:00:05.70,2:00:07.51,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我知道的…
Dialogue: 2,2:00:43.29,2:00:45.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,愛的反面不是憎恨
Dialogue: 2,2:00:46.63,2:00:48.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,愛的反面是冷漠
Dialogue: 2,2:00:50.24,2:00:53.23,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,在我心中有你
Dialogue: 2,2:00:54.38,2:00:57.52,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的心中有我嗎
Dialogue: 2,2:00:59.18,2:01:03.02,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我會因有你而喜悅
Dialogue: 2,2:01:04.22,2:01:08.01,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,你的心中有由我而生力量
Dialogue: 2,2:01:09.85,2:01:12.61,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,是光明還是黑暗都不明白
Dialogue: 2,2:01:14.11,2:01:16.12,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,即使未來一片模糊
Dialogue: 2,2:01:17.07,2:01:23.42,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,但有著緊握的雙手 相互支撐的心
Dialogue: 2,2:01:25.07,2:01:27.30,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,看不見的兩個人也能前進
Dialogue: 2,2:01:29.44,2:01:34.59,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,為了相連的兩個人 為了讓那雙手更有力
Dialogue: 2,2:01:35.58,2:01:37.58,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,互相了解對方吧
Dialogue: 2,2:01:40.25,2:01:41.25,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,願意告訴你
Dialogue: 2,2:01:42.33,2:01:48.36,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,我心中許多的事 小小的事
Dialogue: 2,2:01:50.84,2:01:53.28,Sub-CN,,0,0,0,,所以也請你告訴我
Dialogue: 2,2:01:54.54,2:02:00.62,Sub-CN,是不是少了点,0,0,0,,你心中許多的 小小的故事
